Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have a multiple vehicle，multiple injury accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.21,0:00:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,An absolute mess from Vine Street to the valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.51,0:00:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you're in it，expect a long commute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.51,0:00:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you're not，seek alternate routes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.95,0:00:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,If Dan doesn't want to do a daily rate，we can talk about a weekly rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.45,0:00:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I'm not goin'below a million.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.55,0:00:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me think about it。I'm risking my reputation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.66,0:00:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,as the host of this country's number-one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.82,0:00:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,nationally syndicated talk show to do a cameo in some cheap slasher flick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.83,0:00:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why can't these guys write me a fuckin' decent part？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.16,0:00:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I lived through the fuckin' thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.57,0:00:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,By the way，you talk to Cathy about that Navy SEAL script？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.64,0:00:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？Hello？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.44,0:00:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's this？Who's this？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.91,0:01:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are you calling？You know what？I'm sorry。I have the wrong number.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.68,0:01:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's okay。Wait a minute。I know your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.29,0:01:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,You sound a lot like that guy on TV。Um… Cotton Weary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.39,0:01:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I do，huh？Yeah。I think he's got a really sexy voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.36,0:01:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a minute。You are Cotton，aren't you？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.77,0:01:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God。I am talking to Cotton Weary。I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.34,0:01:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got me。I've got someone on the other line.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.81,0:01:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you hold on one second？I'll be right back，I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.04,0:01:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Andrea，I gotta call you back。Someone's on the other line.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.69,0:01:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,So！You a big 100% Cotton fan？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.06,0:01:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！One hundred and ten percent。That's very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.80,0:01:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，why don't you tell me who you are？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.80,0:01:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ooh！You're a naughty boy。What would your girlfriend say？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.87,0:02:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,What makes you think I have a girlfriend？I know you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.51,0:02:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm right outside her bathroom door。Who is this？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.21,0:02:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's in the shower。She's got a nice little voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.42,0:02:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's come in for a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.49,0:02:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's very pretty，Cotton.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.66,0:02:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,A step up from Maureen Prescott.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.09,0:02:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Speaking of which，let's play a little game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.56,0:02:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Answer right，your girlfriend lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.97,0:02:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Answer wrong，she dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.20,0:02:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's Maureen's daughter，Sidney？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.30,0:02:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who the fuck is this？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.62,0:02:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Somebody who'd kill to know where Sidney Prescott is！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.01,0:02:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,One chance，Cotton！You've got connections。Where is she？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.81,0:02:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You listen，you fuckin' psycho。You lay a finger on Christine，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.50,0:02:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I swear I'll kill you！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.68,0:02:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wrong answer！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！Wait！Hello？Shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.66,0:02:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Get outta the way！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.58,0:02:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just hit me！Move！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.52,0:03:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Christine，if you're there，pick up the phone！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.79,0:03:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Christine，pick up the phone！Oh shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.52,0:03:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have reached 911。Due to the volume of calls…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.92,0:03:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone pick up the goddamn phone！Move outta the way！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.43,0:04:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.95,0:04:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cotton，is that you？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.79,0:04:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cotton？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.06,0:04:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honey？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.38,0:04:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，Cotton.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.03,0:05:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know I don't like your Stab games.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.90,0:05:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who is it？Who's there？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.60,0:05:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Christine？Hon，you all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.87,0:05:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm home。Jesus！You scared the shit outta me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.30,0:05:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll never believe what Just happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.95,0:05:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.99,0:05:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get the hell out of here！Okay，I'm sorry，babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.23,0:05:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to scare you that bad。It's me。Come on，open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.20,0:05:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？What the fuck are you doing？What？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.97,0:05:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was just trying to take the game to the next level.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.77,0:05:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry。Come on，open the door，Chris。The game？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.04,0:05:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，the game！What are you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.75,0:05:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Talking about how much fun it's gonna be to rip your insides out！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.85,0:06:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，open the fuckin'door，Christine！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.98,0:06:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.09,0:06:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now you're fuckin'history，baby！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.41,0:06:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Christine？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.44,0:06:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hon？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.35,0:06:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,The recent epidemic of road rage in Los Angeles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.29,0:06:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Innocent commuters，mercilessly terrorized，Chris？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.52,0:06:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,even killed by these madmen of the freeway。Don't mess around，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.79,0:06:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna make them confront their victims facetoface，mano a mano，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.00,0:06:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,right here on 100% Cotton.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.93,0:06:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Carnage on our streets。And remember，it could happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tomorrow on 100% Cotton！Road rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.51,0:07:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,L.A。drivers fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.64,0:07:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,The news is next on channel six with
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.31,0:07:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,our exclusive entertainment report live…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.35,0:07:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,from tonight's celebrity premiere in Hollywood，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.58,0:07:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,followed by…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.74,0:07:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.23,0:07:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chris？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.36,0:07:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that you，babe？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.40,0:08:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chris，if you're in there，open the door。Okay，honey？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.70,0:08:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chris？Come on，baby。Open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.35,0:08:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chris，whoa，whoa，whoa。Jesus！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.88,0:08:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's me，Chris。What are you doin'？Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.32,0:08:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.12,0:08:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chris，what's goin' on，babe？You've gone crazy。That's what！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.53,0:08:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chris，was somebody in the house？No！Get back！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.83,0:08:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，okay，okay。Just calm down，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.83,0:08:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why do you want to kill me？What are you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.53,0:08:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why do you wanna kill me？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.86,0:08:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gimme the club。All right？Gimme the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.94,0:08:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gimme the club，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.51,0:08:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！Christine，get outta the way！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.01,0:08:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Behind you！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.49,0:08:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.51,0:09:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was a simple game，Cotton。You should've told me where Sidney was.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.38,0:09:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.30,0:09:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.19,0:09:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Cherokee。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.16,0:10:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.08,0:10:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Cherokee.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.40,0:10:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,California Women's Crisis Counseling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.40,0:10:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。It's Laura from Monterey reporting to work。Can you patch me in？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.50,0:10:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure。Thanks，Laura。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.94,0:10:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,California Women's Crisis Counseling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.84,0:10:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,How can I help you？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.17,0:10:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi。Do I have to say my name？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.01,0:11:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，you don't have to say anything you don't want to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.58,0:11:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,How can I help？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.58,0:11:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm 18 years old。And I have a boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.89,0:11:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sometimes he hits me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.12,0:11:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay。You can talk to me，all right？Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.86,0:11:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，in closing，as future journalists of America，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.90,0:11:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,there is one thing you need to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.57,0:11:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Being the best means being willing to do what the others would not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.17,0:11:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Break the rules。Stop at nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.04,0:11:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be willing to have the world hate you，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.62,0:11:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,because that is the only way you'll get the story，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.14,0:11:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,the facts and the fame.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.85,0:11:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.85,0:11:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me。Excuse me。Yes？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.35,0:11:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you're saying that we should be ready to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.81,0:11:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,go out and cut each other's throats…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.56,0:11:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,because that's what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.02,0:11:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Metaphorically，yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.99,0:11:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，tell me，Miss Weathers，was it worth it？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.93,0:11:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry。We're out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.37,0:11:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale Weathers，anchorwoman for Total Entertainment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.67,0:11:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you very much！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.34,0:12:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is a young man outside who wants to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.91,0:12:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,He says he's with the police。The police？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.85,0:12:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Detective Mark Kincaid，L.A.P.D。Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.30,0:12:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's an impressive resume.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.56,0:12:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you。I assume you're not here for an autograph.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.89,0:12:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm here because Cotton Weary's been murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.51,0:12:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone killed Cotton？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.47,0:12:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,And his girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.74,0:12:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone who left something he wanted us to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.50,0:12:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll show you this because you're the Woodsboro authority，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.66,0:12:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,and because you knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.71,0:12:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I promise you，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.77,0:12:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,if you share this with the world，it's you I'll be arresting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.24,0:12:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I swear on my Pulitzer Prize，which I plan to win one day，Detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.45,0:12:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,This was left on Cotton Weary's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.00,0:12:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have any idea who the girl might be？Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.85,0:12:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is Maureen Prescott.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.54,0:12:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is Sidney Prescott's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.46,0:12:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hollywood is reeling today from news
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.66,0:12:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,of the murder of controversial talk show host Cotton Weary.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.23,0:12:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Weary had only recently finished shooting a cameo as himself in the film
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.97,0:12:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stab 3，return to Woodsboro，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.90,0:13:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,the third and final part of the famous horror series…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.70,0:13:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,based on the Woodsboro and Windsor College murders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.41,0:13:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Before his rise to television fame，Cotton had been imprisoned，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.38,0:13:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,and was later exonerated for
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.69,0:13:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,the murder of Maureen Prescott，his former love…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.39,0:13:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just yesterday，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.43,0:13:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cotton Weary was shooting here at Sunrise Studios，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.20,0:13:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,his first cameo in a feature film，Stab 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.60,0:13:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Security here is tight，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.10,0:13:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,but we'll see if we can get a statement。Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.37,0:13:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Always a controversial man…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.37,0:13:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Channel Eight news。We gotta get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.54,0:13:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,No press beyond this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.92,0:13:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，you're worried about the movie，then protect the movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.79,0:13:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hire more security。Hire the National Guard。Just don't kill the movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.99,0:14:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Violence in cinema is a big deal right now，Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is not the kind of news this studio is after.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.43,0:14:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，if we stop making scary movies，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.06,0:14:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,what，all the psychos will retire？Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.47,0:14:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been makin' horror movies for 30 years，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.78,0:14:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,and never had a psycho problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.20,0:14:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was your goddamn idea guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.73,0:14:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,An excon with a trashy talk show？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.53,0:14:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,He must've pissed people off everyday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.38,0:14:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Detectives，there's no reason to presume Cotton's death…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.95,0:14:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,had anything to do with this movie，is there？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.28,0:14:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was making a movie called Stab。He was stabbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.19,0:14:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Probably some psycho fan pissed off they killed Randy in Stab 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.13,0:14:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tyson，that'd make you next，wouldn't it？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.23,0:14:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am not a Randy substitute。I'm my own character.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.23,0:14:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Named Ricky，who works at the video store。It's an homage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.84,0:14:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！What if the killer's Sidney Prescott？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.37,0:14:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，what the hell ever happened to her？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.91,0:14:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's probably in the woods livin' like the fuckin' Unabomber，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.25,0:14:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm starting to see why Tori Spelling
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.83,0:14:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,and David Schwimmer didn't want to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.48,0:14:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guys，this was about Cotton。We are not in any danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.82,0:15:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,「We are not in any danger，」 says Candy，page 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.99,0:15:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't see you leavin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.86,0:15:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ha！You think serious black actors my age
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.42,0:15:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,can just throw away jobs？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.13,0:15:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all a business now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.22,0:15:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,They got Usher doing Pinter offBroadway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.20,0:15:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,L.L。CoolJ's Shakespearin' in the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.47,0:15:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.21,0:15:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe it's not meant to be。Not meant to be？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.58,0:15:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You win that talent search for the new Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.58,0:15:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,50，000 girls and they pick you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.01,0:15:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,You gotta be praying this movie keeps going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.35,0:15:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course I am，but not at the expense of people's lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.22,0:15:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。Cue the violins，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.89,0:15:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.43,0:15:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.37,0:15:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Deja voodoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.88,0:15:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need this area cleared，please。Clear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.98,0:16:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale Weathers！Oh，my God！Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.85,0:16:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，I know we've never met，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.95,0:16:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I don't mind you never returning my calls，but I have to tell you，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.46,0:16:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,after two films，I feel like I am in your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.96,0:16:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,That would explain my constant headaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.06,0:16:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，I'm sorry things didn't work out on 60 Minutes II.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.10,0:16:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,But Total Entertainment，that's a pretty good fallback.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.28,0:16:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.54,0:16:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry things didn't work out with Brad Pitt，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.85,0:16:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,but being single，that's a good fallback.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.64,0:16:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gives me more time for my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.28,0:16:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,After all，Gale Weathers，you're such a complex character.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.08,0:16:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，and to be played by an actress with such depth and range.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.78,0:16:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，Jennifer，Nick said you wanted to…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.35,0:16:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.36,0:16:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.26,0:16:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，surprise，surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.26,0:16:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone dies and Gale comes running.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.07,0:16:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale，I think you'll really appreciate my character work in this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.54,0:16:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone's helped me understand the real you。Someone？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.34,0:17:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your ruthless ambition，your private selfloathing，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.85,0:17:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,and that lost and lonely little girl inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.11,0:17:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lost and lonely what？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.18,0:17:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,You heard me。Thanks，Dewey，I'll return it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.15,0:17:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lost and lonely what？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.16,0:17:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Little girl inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.49,0:17:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought you were supposed to be in Woodsboro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.59,0:17:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I'm surprised you thought about me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.76,0:17:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I gotta get back to work。I really don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.47,0:17:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a minute。You work here？Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.77,0:17:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,The movie needed a technical advisor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.90,0:17:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone who went through the real experience，knew the real people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.47,0:17:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Dewey。Hey。Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.71,0:17:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！It's the real Gale Weathers。Real from top to bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.35,0:17:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tom Prinze。Watch your show all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.75,0:17:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're so right。Pop culture is the politics of the 21st century.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.56,0:17:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.76,0:17:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,And that story that you did last month on me crashing my car？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.79,0:17:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow，was that ever powerful journalism。Right，um，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.20,0:17:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I especially liked the way you implied that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.23,0:17:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,it was caused by drinking and drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.57,0:18:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,And that the tire blowout was faked。That was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.77,0:18:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tom，sometimes in journalism you have to…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.54,0:18:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you parked in the lot？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.54,0:18:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I should check to make sure nobody's messed with your brake line.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.05,0:18:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's he supposed to be？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.68,0:18:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's playing you？Him？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.62,0:18:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.83,0:18:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I did not come here to fight with you，Dewey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.16,0:18:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cotton's killer left a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.19,0:18:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of Sid's mom。The detectives told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.17,0:18:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Does Sidney know about it？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.53,0:18:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，Sidney doesn't need you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.04,0:18:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,and your camera in her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.24,0:18:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you see a camera？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.07,0:18:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.28,0:18:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,You bought me this purse，didn't you？Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.81,0:18:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a habit。I walk outta the house，I turn it on and…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.32,0:18:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell is this？Gale Weathers？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.42,0:18:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Could I be more popular？No press.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.92,0:18:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mo press on set。Get that woman outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.62,0:18:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。Mr。Milton。Let's go。Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.62,0:19:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is Detective Kincaid？I am working with Kincaid，Dewey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.16,0:19:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rules are rules，Gale.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.16,0:19:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，really，it was great seeing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.80,0:19:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stab 3 is a closed set.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.77,0:19:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,But just up ahead is the old Seinfeld stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.51,0:19:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，does any body need a potty break？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.77,0:19:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，I do。Yeah，me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.41,0:19:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，let go！Thanks for your help，boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.25,0:19:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Holy shit，Silent Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.43,0:19:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's that TV news chick，Conniefuckin' Chung！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.02,0:19:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Connie，how's Maury？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.66,0:19:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dude，I think she likes me。See how she's lookin' at me？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.16,0:19:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's happening again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.33,0:19:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cotton had a lot of enemies，Sid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.77,0:19:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,The police aren't saying it's related to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.17,0:19:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you ever think about her？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.58,0:19:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your mom？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.61,0:19:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,None of this would've ever happened if she hadn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.78,0:19:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,If she hadn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.39,0:20:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why'd she have so many secrets，Dad？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.39,0:20:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，maybe it's time you came home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.69,0:20:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm worried about you，kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.98,0:20:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Out here by yourself。You never see anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.23,0:20:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,The only people you talk to don't even know your real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.24,0:20:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's as if you don't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.44,0:20:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the idea。Psychos can't kill what they can't find.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.62,0:21:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid，come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.59,0:21:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mother needs to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.83,0:21:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everything you touch，Sid，dies！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.63,0:21:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're poison。You're just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.54,0:21:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're Just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.67,0:22:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God！What have they done to me？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.15,0:22:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,They'll do it to you。They'll do it to you，baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.37,0:22:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mom？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.70,0:23:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roman？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.21,0:23:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stab 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.21,0:23:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus，I gotta get a new agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.18,0:23:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roman？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.49,0:23:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone here？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.20,0:23:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stan，my man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.40,0:23:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,He does good work，huh？Thank you。Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.37,0:23:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck you very much。Tyson，go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.71,0:23:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse us，Sarah。Makeup tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.58,0:23:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，makeup。You can use it。Have you seen Roman？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.01,0:23:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everyone in the office has gone home already。He said it was important.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.88,0:23:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everything's important to Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.11,0:24:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.95,0:24:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.32,0:24:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Director's office。Sarah，it's Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.09,0:24:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm running late.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.44,0:24:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm still on the 405。I'm about ten minutes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.99,0:24:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，it's no problem。I'm just lookin' at your music video awards.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.77,0:24:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Since I got you on the phone，let's talk about your character，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.97,0:24:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,What character？I'm Candy，the chick who gets killed second.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.00,0:24:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm only in two scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.01,0:24:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not happy with your part.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.08,0:24:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not happy that
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.92,0:24:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am 35 playing a 21yearold.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.18,0:24:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not happy that I have to die naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.32,0:24:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I'm not happy that my character
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.79,0:24:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,is too stupid to have a gun in the house…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.45,0:25:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,after her boyfriend's been cut into fish sticks。Mmhmm，mmhmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.55,0:25:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great，okay。So let's run the lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.22,0:25:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.59,0:25:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Page 28。Candy's big moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.20,0:25:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Page 28.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.97,0:25:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ringring。Hello？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.57,0:25:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？Who's this？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.37,0:25:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's this？This is Candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.58,0:25:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang on。Let me get some clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.71,0:25:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,See？I don't understand why I have to start the scene in the shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.85,0:25:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,The whole shower thing's been done。Vertigo。Hello？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.65,0:25:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I mean，my boyfriend just died。Why am I showering？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.19,0:25:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't we Just read the scene？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.43,0:25:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Candy。Nice name.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.40,0:25:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that like Candy Cane or Candy Apple？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.66,0:25:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.10,0:25:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，who is this？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.54,0:25:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think you have the wrong number.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.11,0:25:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you know my favorite name？I'm hanging up right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.74,0:25:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.74,0:25:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roman，that's not the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.38,0:26:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is in my script.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.98,0:26:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Has there been another goddamn rewrite？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.62,0:26:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,How are the fuck we supposed to learn our lines when there's a new script every 15 minutes？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.16,0:26:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not just a new script。It's a new movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.13,0:26:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？What movie？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.26,0:26:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,My movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.93,0:26:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,And it's called Sarah Gets Skewered Like a Fuckin' Pig！Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.97,0:26:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Still in character… Sarah？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.26,0:26:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.85,0:27:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you for calling Sunrise Picture Studios.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.45,0:27:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you'd like today's commissary menu，press one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.99,0:27:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Bridger？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.27,0:27:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you'd like to hear previews of upcoming Sunrise Pictures' releases，press four.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.11,0:27:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you'd like information about merchandise，press five。Come on，come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.52,0:27:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you're trying to reach Lot Security or you have an emergency，press six.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.53,0:27:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.71,0:28:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！Fuck！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.16,0:28:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，I wanna get something straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.96,0:28:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I only got into this because the police asked for my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.63,0:28:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why would the police come to you？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.93,0:28:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I did write the definitive book on the Woodsboro murders.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.17,0:28:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sure you just can't wait to write another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.14,0:28:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about you？What about me？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.98,0:28:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,You said you'd never leave Woodsboro.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.41,0:28:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,「The only place that's real.」
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.75,0:28:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,But now you're here。Not with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.59,0:28:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey，I took care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.69,0:28:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I waited until you were well，but I couldn't stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.62,0:28:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was like dog years.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.43,0:28:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,One year in Woodsboro is like seven anywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.09,0:29:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,So it's off to Paris for a week？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.03,0:29:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,New York for a month？L.A。forever？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.36,0:29:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was fucking 60 Minutes II。I couldn't say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.46,0:29:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I could've been the next Diane Sawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.90,0:29:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's wrong with just being Gale Weathers？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.45,0:29:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I liked her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.31,0:29:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,It didn't work，Dewey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.16,0:29:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,We tried。We're different.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.05,0:29:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,You used to say that was our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.62,0:29:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well… Here you go。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.56,0:29:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey，you're not just here because of that secondrate KMart，
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.76,0:29:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,straighttovideo version of me，are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.90,0:29:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brace yourself，Gale。All of this is actually not about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.40,0:29:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,All of what，Dewey？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.47,0:29:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,You do know something，don't you？Off the record？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.64,0:29:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.94,0:29:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two months ago，the Woodsboro police got a call from a woman…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.88,0:29:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,who said she was with Stab 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.88,0:29:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,She wanted to see the file on Sid，
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.30,0:29:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,「for research.」 And？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.59,0:30:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,The boys said no。And she wouldn't give her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.89,0:30:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,A month later，the station gets broken into.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.96,0:30:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,The file room gets ransacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.36,0:30:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,And someone stole Sid's file？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.96,0:30:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I already removed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.97,0:30:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think someone on the film is tryin' to find Sid.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.00,0:30:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，this is incredible。I said，「off the record.」
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.17,0:30:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.41,0:30:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's Jennifer。She needs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.42,0:30:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jennifer？Gotta run.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.48,0:30:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait！Dewey，where are you going？I'm on duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.20,0:30:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop following me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.44,0:30:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I happen to be working for the police，damn it！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.77,0:30:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not a detective，Gale Neither are you，Mr。Incognito.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.51,0:31:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，you left your motor running。Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.62,0:31:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fans，I can handle。Fans，they want a picture，
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.72,0:31:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,they want a conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.19,0:31:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can handle fans！You see this，Dewey？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.19,0:31:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I haven't had one of these in a year and a half。Someone's gonna pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.16,0:31:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jennifer，settle down。What happened？I'm with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.56,0:31:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,You。Like I'm ever going to win an award playing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.73,0:31:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's been a second murder。Who？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.67,0:31:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sarah Darling。Where？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.50,0:31:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,At the studio。Where？Nancy Drew wants to know where！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.11,0:31:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cotton Weary。Sarah Darling。Don't you get it？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.38,0:31:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone's killing them in the order they die in the movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.82,0:31:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey，who gets killed third？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.08,0:31:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who gets killed third？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.59,0:31:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.07,0:32:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I get killed in Stab 3？I get killed？Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.68,0:32:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey，where are you going？I have to get something from my trailer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.65,0:32:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,You live here with her？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.95,0:32:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Oh，my God！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.85,0:32:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I needed a place to stay，and she said she liked having me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.35,0:32:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.36,0:32:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,She says I make her feel safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.76,0:32:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,She says I'm her rock。Her rock？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.83,0:32:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。If you weren't so concerned with pretensions and appearances，
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.87,0:32:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,you'd be able to appreciate the positivity and emotional centeredness I provide a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.97,0:32:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stone，I'm headed to the crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.08,0:32:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,You stay by Jennifer's side。I suggest a search of the grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.88,0:32:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Dewdrop。Can I have a word？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.55,0:32:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just so we can be straight。I'm a professional celebrity guard here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.99,0:32:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,My resume lists Julia Roberts，
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.67,0:32:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Salmon Rushdie，Posh Spice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.46,0:32:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are the Hollywood，uh，hangeroner.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.63,0:32:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,'Cause you're just no good as a cop anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.86,0:32:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your resume reads like the obituaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.87,0:33:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,So how 'bout you take suggestions from me？All right？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.97,0:33:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whatever you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.67,0:33:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hmm。Same deal？Found with the body？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.34,0:33:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，Maureen Prescott again。This is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.91,0:33:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ten more murders and we can publish a calendar.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.28,0:33:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,The old 「killer playing with the cops」 routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.58,0:33:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very Hannibal Lecter。Very Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.12,0:33:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doesn't the killer come after the cops in those movies？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.46,0:33:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Usually one cop makes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.53,0:33:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,And？One cop doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.96,0:33:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Usually.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.97,0:33:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Detective Kincaid，what do we know？Same killer？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.47,0:33:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，hey，Terminal Entertainment，this is a crime scene，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.91,0:33:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wallace，Miss Weathers is working with me now。Thank you，Detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.14,0:33:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're welcome。Well，in that case，
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.14,0:33:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go dust for fingerprints with Jane Pauley.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.95,0:33:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Photos，Wallace，please？Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.55,0:33:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,New pictures，same person。Anything turn up on your research yet？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.12,0:33:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing that will help with these.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.56,0:33:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about police around Jennifer？She's the next one to get killed in the script.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.53,0:34:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,She has a bodyguard。Besides，there were three different versions of the script.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.63,0:34:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Something about trying to keep the ending off the Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.75,0:34:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,You should know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.37,0:34:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're the technical advisor，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.37,0:34:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three versions。Three different characters die next.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.41,0:34:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,And we don't know which one the killer read.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.81,0:34:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.58,0:34:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,All I ever wanted to do was make a real classic love story.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.52,0:34:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,The studio said they'd let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.52,0:34:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just had to do a scary movie for them first.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.49,0:34:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now we're shut down and I am fucked！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.86,0:34:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,God，it's not the end of the world，Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.19,0:34:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is so easy for you to say。You can always go back to Must See TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.63,0:34:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have no movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.12,0:34:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm about to turn 30，and it looks like I'm the next target.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.53,0:34:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？You？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.03,0:34:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why you？Do you think this wasn't a message？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.57,0:34:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roman Bridger？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.54,0:34:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？Mr。Bridger，you didn't tell us you spoke…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.24,0:34:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,with Sarah Darling before she was murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.48,0:34:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spoke with her when？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.61,0:34:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,The guard said she was here for a meeting with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.02,0:35:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,What meeting？I don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.09,0:35:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,We talked with her roommate.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.48,0:35:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Says you called Sarah，told her to come to the studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.02,0:35:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roommate answered the phone。Says it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.09,0:35:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a minute。I never called her。I never told her to go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.46,0:35:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roommate says she knows your voice，Mr。Bridger.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.10,0:35:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,She wasn't speaking with me！God！Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.10,0:35:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I did not call Sarah Darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.10,0:35:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sarah Darling said you did。Someone's trying to ruin my movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.37,0:35:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone wants to kill my movie！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.44,0:35:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll talk about your movie at the station。All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.44,0:35:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is the scene where you come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.18,0:35:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey，Jennifer… Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.55,0:35:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,She wasn't talking with me on the phone。I'm coming！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.59,0:35:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll call him in。Battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.06,0:35:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Riley，do you have a cell phone I can borrow？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.62,0:35:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.26,0:35:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.43,0:35:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,God。Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.20,0:35:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remind me not to sleep with him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.07,0:35:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come here，Cherokee.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.77,0:35:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,California Women's Crisis Counseling。My name is Laura.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.60,0:35:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,How can I help you？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.44,0:35:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Laura。I do have a crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.61,0:36:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，whatever it is，you can tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.41,0:36:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God。I've killed someone，Laura
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.12,0:36:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you sure？Uhhuh，I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.32,0:36:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I killed someone，I know it！Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.62,0:36:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，then… I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.26,0:36:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then the people you need to call are the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.30,0:36:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I need to call you！Just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.87,0:36:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，your… your voice…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.94,0:36:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you wanna know how you can help，Laura？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.44,0:36:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you listening to me？Huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.18,0:36:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who is this？It's Mother，Laura.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.65,0:36:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，be a good girl and turn on the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.45,0:36:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do as Mother tells you！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.36,0:36:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not my mother。How did you get this number？Who is this？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.36,0:36:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know your mother's voice when you hear it！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.33,0:36:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，turn on the news！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.30,0:36:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,And with a second cast member murdered，Stab 3
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.57,0:37:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,has been officially shut down，prompting those involved
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.41,0:37:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,to hope and pray that these killings may be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.71,0:37:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just one question.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.05,0:37:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you think it's over，Sidney？Do you？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.92,0:37:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is this a wrap party or is this a wrap party？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.36,0:37:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scene 34。「Maureen's Murder Flashback.」
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.56,0:37:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I never liked that scene。That's 'cause you weren't in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.37,0:38:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scenes 40 through 47.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.57,0:38:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,「The Prescott House Flashbacks。」 Tom，stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.48,0:38:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're scaring me。Two people are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.54,0:38:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scaring you？Ha！Give the sweet，young ingenue act a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.48,0:38:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're drunk。I'm coping.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.22,0:38:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I bet she fought and clawed for that Sidney part.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.93,0:38:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I bet she stepped on any poor girl that got in her way.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.19,0:38:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you asked her out and she said no？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.60,0:38:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,That has nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.17,0:38:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。Come on，Dewey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.70,0:38:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scene 50。「Dewey Saves the Day.」
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.04,0:39:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's so focused on success she never thinks about who she's hurting to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.21,0:39:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you saved her life，like，how many times？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.51,0:39:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale wants the whole world to love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.51,0:39:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,One person's never enough。She's a dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.45,0:39:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，she's a narcissistic，psycho bitch。No，she's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.89,0:39:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's got a good heart。She does.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.19,0:39:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,She just hides it away
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.44,0:39:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,because she thinks people see that as weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.33,0:39:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is a good picture of you。You look just like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.53,0:39:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,God，Dewey.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.77,0:39:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,You make it sound like you're still in love with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.20,0:39:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I left out the part that she's cruel…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.57,0:39:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,and selfish，obsessive and annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.81,0:39:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have one Gale Weathers here。We don't need two.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.82,0:40:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Dewdrop，got your girlfriend out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.82,0:40:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look who I found slinkin' around the yard。The nightly news.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.36,0:40:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wasn't slinking。I was walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.49,0:40:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were eavesdropping at the bedroom window.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.23,0:40:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，a bedroom that you seemed awfully at home in.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.40,0:40:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.27,0:40:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.91,0:40:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's this about，Gale？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.04,0:40:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you know they released Roman？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.08,0:40:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sarah's call didn't come from his cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.08,0:40:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where did it come from？A cloned cell phone。It's untraceable.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.55,0:40:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks for that update，Gale。Why don't you just go back home？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.75,0:40:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey，wait a minute。Just wait one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.52,0:40:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,How old do you think Maureen Prescott is in this picture？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.39,0:40:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nineteen，twenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.37,0:40:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what I thought，so I checked it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.33,0:40:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I cannot find any information about her at this age.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.34,0:40:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.83,0:40:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,She lived in Woodsboro her whole life。Someone there must know something.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.40,0:40:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Almost her whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.37,0:40:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two years before she met Sidney's father，she left Woodsboro.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.74,0:40:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,No one has any idea where she went or what she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.44,0:41:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's like she fell into a black hole，Dewey！She vanished！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.71,0:41:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,So？So？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.95,0:41:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why is the killer leaving pictures of Maureen？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.75,0:41:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,And why these pictures at that point in her life？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.99,0:41:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.49,0:41:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I thought like a homicidal maniac，
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.92,0:41:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,then I'd know how a homicidal maniac thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.00,0:41:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.97,0:41:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jennifer。Jennifer？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.81,0:41:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at the buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.81,0:41:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,The second story。There and there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.25,0:41:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the same！It's the same street 28 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.45,0:41:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God。Maureen Prescott was at the back lot at Sunrise Studios！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.32,0:41:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God。I gotta make some calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.57,0:42:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Steven Stone Protection Services.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.68,0:42:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stone，where are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.68,0:42:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm just checking your tin can，Dewdrop.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.45,0:42:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，come back inside and stay with Jennifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.48,0:42:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Something's happened。I have to go to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.78,0:42:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that an order，Dewdrop？'Cause Steven Stone doesn't work for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.46,0:42:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get back in the house。Would I call you if it wasn't important？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.16,0:42:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing in there anyway？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.16,0:42:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Me？I'm just checking to make sure there's no killer in here…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.87,0:42:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,waitin' to off you like he did your little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.80,0:42:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,What did you say？I can't believe you said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.97,0:42:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,That makes me…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.37,0:42:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Angry！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.31,0:42:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fucker！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.03,0:42:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gotta call Kincaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.03,0:43:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey，where is everybody？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.27,0:43:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.54,0:43:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God。Jennifer？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.61,0:43:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Angelina？Tom？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.42,0:43:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God！What happened？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.25,0:43:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ohh！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.72,0:43:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't do that。I'm overreacting.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.06,0:43:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewdrop？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.74,0:43:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stone？Oh，my God！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.97,0:43:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God，Stone！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.98,0:43:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.48,0:43:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey，is he dead？Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.46,0:43:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everyone back inside！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.93,0:44:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all right。Don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.60,0:44:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，outside。Everyone，stay together and try to remain calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.20,0:44:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not mine。Not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.24,0:44:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！It's the fax.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.85,0:44:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Interior，Jennifer's house。Living room，night.」
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.87,0:44:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a script page.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.95,0:44:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,W… What's it say？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.50,0:44:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,「With the bodyguard stabbed，the five stand trapped.」
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.09,0:44:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's rewriting the movie。「As the killer waits outside，
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.06,0:44:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,suddenly the fax machine sends news of their fates.「
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.70,0:44:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a trick！Everybody outside！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.20,0:44:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Outside where he can pick us off one by one？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.23,0:44:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,「The killer prepares to grant mercy to only one of them.」
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.50,0:44:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you get it？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.56,0:44:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,The killer says he's outside because he wants us here inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.87,0:44:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which one is it？Come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.28,0:44:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Who will survive？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.96,0:44:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is it Jennifer？Tom？Angelina？Dewey？Gale？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.01,0:44:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,The killer will give mercy to…「 Everyone outside！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.31,0:44:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,He grants mercy to who？I wanna know what happens！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.59,0:45:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait for the fucking movie！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.52,0:45:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've gotta know！I'm goin' back in！No.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.62,0:45:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，everyone，back。Stay together.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.36,0:45:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's it say？And the…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.66,0:45:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,killer will give mercy to…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.90,0:45:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,whoever… Whoever？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.47,0:45:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.44,0:45:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Whoever… Whoever smells the…」
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.66,0:45:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't stop rolling down the hill！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.54,0:45:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale！Jennifer！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.47,0:45:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey！Dewey！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.54,0:45:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey，where are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.65,0:46:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Over here，Dewey！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.18,0:46:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey！Gale！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.06,0:46:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale，behind you！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.07,0:46:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey！Are you all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.61,0:46:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，never been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.88,0:46:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I'm all right。Where'd he go？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.55,0:46:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,He must've rolled under the car。All right，stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.59,0:46:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is he back there？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.69,0:46:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。No？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.56,0:46:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's fast。Could've sworn I hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.84,0:46:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.27,0:47:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.77,0:47:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks for saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.81,0:47:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，it's habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.18,0:47:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.92,0:47:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.69,0:47:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,happened to you？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.96,0:47:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jennifer，wait a minute。Who gave you a place to stay？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.63,0:47:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are you supposed to be protecting？Jennifer！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.06,0:47:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.94,0:47:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,My lawyer liked that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.01,0:47:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not as much as I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.85,0:47:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Angelina？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.65,0:47:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tom was in the house。How'd you end up way over there？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.02,0:47:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God！Tom was in the house！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.19,0:47:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are we safe？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.70,0:47:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Safe from who？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.60,0:48:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a second！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.24,0:48:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Another picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.85,0:48:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.85,0:48:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoever it is
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.60,0:48:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,is now taking credit for Maureen Prescott's murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.72,0:48:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,But we know who killed Maureen Prescott.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.54,0:48:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Billy Loomis and Stu Macher.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.89,0:48:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,They even told Sidney how they did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.29,0:48:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，but if I'm not mistaken，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.36,0:48:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,you said in your book that Sidney got it wrong once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.73,0:48:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,She accused Cotton Weary of murdering her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.57,0:48:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was sent away for it。Maybe there is a third killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.74,0:48:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney might know something。I told you。I don't know where Sidney is.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.37,0:48:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,And even if there was a third killer，Sidney doesn't know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.08,0:48:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is for me to decide。I need to talk to her。She's a key element in this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.45,0:48:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have a press conference in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.58,0:48:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need to explain why there are three dead celebrities and a bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.45,0:48:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,And a very angry mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.55,0:48:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，we all know this has something to do with Stab 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.26,0:48:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,But what we do not know is why the killer keeps leaving pictures…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.16,0:49:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,of Maureen Prescott taken over 25 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.83,0:49:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,And the photographs taken at the same studio Stab 3 is shooting out of.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.23,0:49:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,What does this have to do with Sid？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.40,0:49:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who knows more about Maureen Prescott than her own daughter？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.17,0:49:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid's dad couldn't help you and he was married to Maureen.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.97,0:49:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's your problem？Last night you were almost charcoal.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.08,0:49:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,You gonna help us or what？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.02,0:49:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you wanna have this conversation with a polygraph？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.78,0:49:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that a threat？When it's a threat，you'll know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.15,0:49:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Was that a threat？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.15,0:49:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boys，boys！Why don't we compare our gun calibers later？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.26,0:49:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,The issue is Maureen Prescott.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.93,0:49:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wrong。The issue is Sidney Prescott.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.83,0:49:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,And either Mr。Riley is going to obstruct justice or put me in touch with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.96,0:49:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,So… where is she？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.41,0:49:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，you've reached the machine。Leave a message。Talk as long as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.98,0:49:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid，it's me。This is the fifth time I've called.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.75,0:49:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please pick up。I wanna make sure you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.72,0:50:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.59,0:50:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.36,0:50:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing down here？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.63,0:50:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！Actually，what was I doing up there？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.23,0:50:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus，Dewey，are you okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.23,0:50:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.17,0:50:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is she all right？Hey，you know Gale。It'd take a direct hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.97,0:50:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,So the news said this was the precinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.37,0:50:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's this guy Kincaid？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.84,0:50:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.94,0:50:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you to stay hidden。It's not safe for you to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.35,0:50:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,The killer called me。What？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.22,0:50:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，he found me。I'm no more safe there than I am here，
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.22,0:50:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,and at least here I'm not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.69,0:50:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.70,0:50:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Detective Kincaid？Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.03,0:50:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's someone here who wants to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.03,0:50:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God。Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.90,0:50:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is the man fast or what？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.74,0:50:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi。Hi，Gale.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.18,0:51:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're all right。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.48,0:51:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid，this is Detective Kincaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.97,0:51:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice to finally meet you，Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.52,0:51:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,The killer called her.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.35,0:51:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？When？What did he say？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.62,0:51:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，you know，the usual small talk。What's new，
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.41,0:51:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,how you been，how do you wanna die？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.13,0:51:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney，do you have any idea how he could've gotten your number？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.43,0:51:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,He could have monitored her calls on a scanner.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.19,0:51:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you call her from the set？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.37,0:51:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Do you have her number stored in your memory？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.24,0:51:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Phone memory！Oh。Yeah，guess I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.51,0:51:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Has anyone else ever used your phone？Just Jennifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.58,0:51:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.68,0:51:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，I'm the cop here。You're in my office，Riley.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.39,0:51:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,The killer leaves a photograph after each murder，Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.09,0:51:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,They were taken in Hollywood at the same studio that they're shooting Stab 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.30,0:51:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me？This is my mother，Dewey.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.58,0:51:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say something？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.97,0:51:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was afraid they were bait。Something to，you know，trick you out of hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.37,0:52:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney，was she an actress or a model？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.70,0:52:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,They look a lot like publicity stills.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.14,0:52:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I，uh，don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.98,0:52:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Detective，I wanna see this place in the pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.58,0:52:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you sure？Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.52,0:52:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Slow it down。Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.16,0:52:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch the fuckin' aliens.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.90,0:52:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go talk to the studio brass about those photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.43,0:52:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，right。I know where you're goin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.43,0:52:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep an eye on Sidney。I know where you're goin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.87,0:52:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're gonna get her some flowers and candy，huh？Huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.61,0:52:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gimme a break。Yeah，gimme a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.84,0:52:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just keep your eye on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.18,0:52:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,That stairwell over there，that's where one of the pictures was taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.29,0:52:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't believe she never mentioned any of this。Dewey！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.96,0:52:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry。Martha！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.76,0:52:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God，Sidney。Hey，hold it right there！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.86,0:53:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't shoot。I'm only 17。It's okay。We know her.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.27,0:53:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,We do？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.30,0:53:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell me that's his exgirlfriend，I'll shoot myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.27,0:53:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's Martha Meeks，Randy's sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.77,0:53:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Randy's sister？Yeah，can't you tell？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.34,0:53:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,We miss you in Woodsboro guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.09,0:53:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Martha，what are you doing here？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.54,0:53:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's something you guys should see.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.52,0:53:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Told ya I'd make a movie someday。Huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.15,0:53:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.09,0:53:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，if you're watching this tape，
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.62,0:53:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,it means，as I feared，I did not survive these killings
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.73,0:53:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,here at Windsor College，and that giving up my virginit
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.63,0:53:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,to Karen Kolchak at the video store was probably not a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.07,0:53:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Karen Kolchak？Yes，Karen Kolchak.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.23,0:53:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Creepy Karen」？Shut up！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.37,0:53:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's a sweet person，okay？We were working late.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.61,0:53:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,We were putting away some videos in the porno section，and，you know，shit happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.18,0:53:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Open the door，Randy！Fifteen minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.65,0:53:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's my room too！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.14,0:53:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Paul，15 minutes。I'm leaving my legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.92,0:53:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fifteen minutes，Paul！Damn！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.99,0:53:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anyway，the reason I'm here is to help you…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.09,0:54:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,so that my death will not be in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.19,0:54:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,That my life's work will help save some other poor soul from getting mutilated.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.43,0:54:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,If this killer does come back，
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.83,0:54:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,and he's for real，there are a few things that you gotta remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.67,0:54:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is this simply another sequel？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.03,0:54:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，if it is，same rules apply.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.14,0:54:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，here's the critical thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.21,0:54:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you find yourself dealing with an unexpected backstory，
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.75,0:54:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,and a preponderance of exposition，then the sequel rules do not apply.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.35,0:54:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because you're not dealing with the sequel。You are dealing with…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.09,0:54:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,the concluding chapter of a trilogy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.39,0:54:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Trilogy。That's right。It's a rarity in the horror field，
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.16,0:54:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,but it does exist，and it is a force to be reckoned with.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.03,0:54:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because true trilogies are about going back to the beginning and discovering something…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.40,0:54:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,that wasn't true from the getgo.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.77,0:54:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Godfather，Jedi，all revealed something that we thought was true that wasn't true.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.44,0:54:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,So if it is a trilogy you are dealing with，
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.88,0:54:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,here are some super trilogy rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.11,0:54:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,One：You've got a killer who's gonna be superhuman.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.35,0:54:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stabbing him won't work。Shooting him won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.35,0:54:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Basically，in the third one，
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.47,0:55:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,you've gotta cryogenically freeze his head，decapitate him，
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.55,0:55:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,or blow him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.42,0:55:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Number two：Anyone，including the main character，can die.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.29,0:55:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,This means you，Sid.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.69,0:55:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry。It's the final chapter.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.26,0:55:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,It could be fuckin' 「Reservoir Dogs」 by the time this thing is through.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.90,0:55:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Number three：The past will come back to bite you in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.23,0:55:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whatever you think you know about the past，forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.48,0:55:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,The past is not at rest！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.44,0:55:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any sins you think were committed in the past are about to break out and destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.94,0:55:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,So in closing，let me say…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.21,0:55:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,good luck，Godspeed，
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.02,0:55:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,and for some of you，I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.22,0:55:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,'Cause the rules say some of you ain't gonna make it。I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.76,0:55:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not if you're watching this tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.33,0:55:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.33,0:55:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,You be careful。Say hi to your folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.97,0:55:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,You be careful too，Sid.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.41,0:55:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bye，Dewey。Come visit us soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.41,0:56:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will，Martha。Thank you。Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.23,0:56:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've got an idea。I'll hook up with you guys later。Want us to come with you？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.63,0:56:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I work better alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.82,0:56:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,And why don't you try to figure out where those other pictures were taken？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.81,0:56:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can see nothing's changed。Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.34,0:56:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.75,0:56:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.20,0:56:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jeez。What the hell are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.37,0:56:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Being Gale Weathers。What the hell are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.74,0:56:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am Gale Weathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.30,0:56:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here's how I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.05,0:56:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've got no house，no bodyguard，no movie，
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.10,0:56:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I'm being stalked.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.97,0:56:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because someone wants to kill me？No，because someone wants to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.34,0:56:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now。Starting now，I go where you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.42,0:56:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,That way，if someone wants to kill me，I'll be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.41,0:56:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,And since they really want to kill you，
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.41,0:56:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,they won't kill me，they'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.75,0:57:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make sense？None.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.25,0:57:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，in the movies I play you as being much smarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.79,0:57:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,And as a sane person。For you，that must be quite a stretch.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.39,0:57:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's funny。Ha！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.73,0:57:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Need to get into that building？Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.90,0:57:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is there a story in that building？Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.80,0:57:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale Weathers would find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.44,0:57:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bitch。All right，wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.47,0:57:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just… Don't tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.48,0:57:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Basements，wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.48,0:57:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Basements creep me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.65,0:57:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'd make a fascinating interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.99,0:57:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.00,0:57:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi。Excuse me。I am Gale Weathers，
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.01,0:57:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I'm here researching with the police… this photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.41,0:58:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was taken at the studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.86,0:58:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Her name is Maureen Prescott。Back then it was Roberts.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.18,0:58:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，are you… No.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.62,0:58:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you look just… Like her？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.10,0:58:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been hearing it all my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.99,0:58:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's uncanny。I was up for Princess Leia.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.66,0:58:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was this close。So，who gets it？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.18,0:58:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,The one who sleeps with George Lucas？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.90,0:58:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry。I didn't mean to bring up a sore subject for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.47,0:58:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure，you didn't。None of them did.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.47,0:58:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，how can I help you？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.28,0:58:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or do you want me to tell you who you look like？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.51,0:58:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hmph。How 'bout some information on Maureen Roberts？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.84,0:58:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't work for the cops，sweetie。I work for the studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.35,0:58:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really。Well，would you work for…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.25,0:58:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,the President？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.69,0:58:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,The president… of the studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.66,0:58:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fifty dollars？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.03,0:58:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are you？A reporter for Woodsboro High？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.44,0:59:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's worth two grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.50,0:59:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you gonna help Gale Weathers or not？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.91,0:59:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know every face in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.85,0:59:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got a respect for the unknown actor.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.75,0:59:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,If they're looking for Maureen Roberts，they're never gonna find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.55,0:59:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rina Reynolds they will.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.59,0:59:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rina Reynolds.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.93,0:59:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stage name.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.29,0:59:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,You should talk，Judy Jurgenstern.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.90,0:59:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are these movies？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.90,0:59:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Amazombies，Space Psycho，Creatures from the San Andreas Fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.07,0:59:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Horror pictures back in Milton's heyday.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.48,0:59:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back in what？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.58,0:59:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,John Milton，the horror producer？Those were his movies.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.81,1:00:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Sid.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.17,1:00:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God！Sidney Prescott！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.21,1:00:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God！I'm Angelina Tyler。I'm you！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.02,1:00:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.15,1:00:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.29,1:00:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I… I thought，
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.56,1:01:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,well，if there's no movie，
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.07,1:01:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,no one would care if I took some souvenirs.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.06,1:01:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Souvenirs？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.56,1:01:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I may never win another role，
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.40,1:01:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,so these may be my only memories，
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.40,1:01:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,you know，of Hollywood.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.17,1:01:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know it's weird 'cause it's your life and all，but…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.77,1:01:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wanted to make you proud，Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.18,1:01:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。Well，I'm sure I would've been.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.91,1:01:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,The real Sidney。The real person.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.35,1:01:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wish…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.09,1:01:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wish it would've worked out.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.67,1:01:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.67,1:01:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Angelina？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.02,1:02:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.71,1:03:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Close call.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.71,1:03:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing here？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.81,1:03:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,It occurred to me that I've never snuck through your bedroom window.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.68,1:03:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,See what you do to me？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.92,1:03:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,What you've done to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.92,1:03:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,About the，uh，sex stuff？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.36,1:03:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，I'm not trying to rush you at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.09,1:03:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would you settle for a PG13 relationship？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.28,1:05:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.60,1:06:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.54,1:06:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney，I'm in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.01,1:06:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.75,1:06:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。Mother will protect you from the bogeyman.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.85,1:06:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come into the bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.79,1:06:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hide in Mommy's bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.43,1:06:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I lied，Sidney。I can't protect you at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.53,1:06:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't deserve to be protected！You didn't protect me！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.70,1:06:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You did your mom a favor。That woman was a slutbag whore…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.41,1:06:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,who flashed her shit all over town like she was Sharon Stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.91,1:06:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,'Cause let's face it，Sidney，
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.81,1:06:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,your mother was no Sharon Stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.55,1:06:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney's mother was fucking my father。Sid，where are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.08,1:07:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey！Dewey，help me！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.99,1:07:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney？Give Mommy a kiss and we'll make up.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.06,1:07:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！Sidney！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.53,1:07:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.30,1:07:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid，are you okay？What happened？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.57,1:07:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,The killer's in the house，Dewey。He's upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.74,1:07:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,And my mother… Let's go，let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.38,1:07:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I heard her voice。I saw her，Dewey.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.15,1:07:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Upstairs。Come on，let's go。It's okay，Sid.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.55,1:07:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,You weren't supposed to go in that house。It's all set up for the murder scene.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.96,1:07:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry you had to see that。He was in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.96,1:07:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was in there，I swear，I swear。You know I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.93,1:07:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened？Kincaid，hey。There's nobody up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.94,1:07:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.85,1:08:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.82,1:08:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，so I stole the mask，whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.82,1:08:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Didn't know you got the gas chamber for that？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.35,1:08:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,You stole the mask？I took it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.86,1:08:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,You took the mask or you stole the mask？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.79,1:08:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I took it as like a souvenir。Don't look at me。I didn't take shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.06,1:08:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know he was there。I am not dreaming，I am not crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.30,1:08:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was there in Woodsboro。That's not Woodsboro，Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.93,1:08:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.42,1:08:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,But he was there。He or she，or whoever this is.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.70,1:08:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna take you back to the station，keep you under watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.44,1:08:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put you in a safe house。Whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.01,1:08:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.35,1:08:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all right，Sid。We all believe you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.48,1:08:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's watching。And he wants you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.16,1:08:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Dew。Dew.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.09,1:08:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，we have to go catch up with Sid。Take a look at this first.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.96,1:08:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone we know？Where'd you get this？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.13,1:08:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got it。Archives.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.13,1:08:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney's mother was an actress。Three movies。Horror movies.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.60,1:09:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want to know who produced all three？Who？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.84,1:09:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,There'll be other movies，Roman.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.97,1:09:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not only did they kill the film，but they killed my cast.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.98,1:09:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody's gonna want to work with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.22,1:09:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Variety called me a pariah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.95,1:09:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't even know what a pariah is.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.85,1:09:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why couldn't someone have killed the cast from Stab 1？Huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.22,1:09:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or Stab 2？Why me？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.36,1:09:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,What… John，what did we do wrong？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.72,1:09:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hollywood is full of criminals whose careers are flourishing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.16,1:09:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not a criminal！I was questioned.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.69,1:09:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，but that's all。I was questioned。That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.70,1:09:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's good for your mystique.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.26,1:09:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think it will help me get work？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.80,1:09:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roman。John.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.90,1:09:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jennifer，and guests。To what do I owe the honor？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.17,1:09:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rina Reynolds.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.43,1:09:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rina Reynolds？Who's Rina Reynolds？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.24,1:09:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't you head to the house？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.55,1:09:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell everybody not to cut the cake without me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.51,1:09:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God，I forgot。Your birthday.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.78,1:09:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，as if life isn't tragic enough。Happy birthday，Roman.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.48,1:09:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut the doors behind you，please.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.22,1:09:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，you knew Sidney Prescott's mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.02,1:09:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who？Rina Reynolds？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.59,1:10:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ahh。Do you know how many actors have worked for me？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.20,1:10:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hundreds。Thousands.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.77,1:10:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,We didn't say she was an actor。Good catch.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.07,1:10:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,So what's the point？Uh，no point.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.60,1:10:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm just gonna give Detective Kincaid a call.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.64,1:10:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I remember。She was a bit player in a couple of my movies.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.71,1:10:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,A nobody。So what does it matter？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.45,1:10:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，come on。You have made millions off the story of her murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.02,1:10:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're obsessed with her，and you're obsessed with her daughter！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.92,1:10:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Easy，Geraldo。Why don't you tell us the truth？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.63,1:10:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell are you guys getting at？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.39,1:10:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I make horror films，that's what I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.83,1:10:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,The studio came to me with Stab.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.06,1:10:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,They came to me。Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.03,1:10:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you knew who she was。When we did the first Stab，
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.90,1:10:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I realized I had known Maureen Prescott before。I mean，as Rina.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.78,1:10:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I couldn't tell anyone。Can you imagine the press？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.95,1:10:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now？I mean，murders on your set，
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.58,1:10:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,and still you say nothing？Get real.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.08,1:10:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,That would make me a suspect。Just because you knew her？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.85,1:10:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.32,1:11:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just what did happen to Maureen when she was in Hollywood？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.76,1:11:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，you listen to me，Lois Lane.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.05,1:11:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let it go。It's dead and buried.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.60,1:11:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,How would you like to see it dug up on national TV？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.10,1:11:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't you tell me what happened？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.87,1:11:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was in the '70s。Everything was different.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.81,1:11:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was wellknown for my parties.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.84,1:11:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rina knew what they were.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.21,1:11:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was for girls like her to meet men.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.25,1:11:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Men who could get them parts…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.78,1:11:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,if they made the right impression.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.85,1:11:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing happened to her that she didn't invite in one way or another，
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.66,1:11:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,no matter what she said afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.76,1:11:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you saying she… I'm saying things got out of hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.23,1:11:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe they did take advantage of her。Maybe the sad truth is…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.47,1:11:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,this is not the city for innocents.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.60,1:11:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,No charges were brought。And the bottom line is…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.31,1:11:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rina Reynolds wouldn't play by the rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.14,1:11:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,You wanna get ahead in Hollywood？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.28,1:11:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,You gotta play the game，or go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.19,1:12:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you know about trilogies？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.49,1:12:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,You mean，like movie trilogies？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.13,1:12:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,You seem to like movies，Detective.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.36,1:12:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Call me Mark，would you？'Cause I'm gonna keep calling you Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.06,1:12:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll call you Mark when you catch the killer，Detective.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.40,1:12:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,All I know about movie trilogies is that in the third one…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.21,1:12:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,all bets are off.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.21,1:12:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you request this case？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.21,1:12:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。They tend to put me on the ones that deal with the business.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.02,1:12:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I grew up here，and I know my way around the studios.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.39,1:12:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.75,1:12:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Must be exciting。Beautiful place，beautiful people.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.22,1:12:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,To me，Hollywood is about death.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.39,1:12:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.17,1:12:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a homicide detective，remember？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.67,1:12:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,And when you see what I see，day in and day out，
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.14,1:12:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,the violence that people do to each other，
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.84,1:12:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,you get haunted.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.88,1:13:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think you know about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.11,1:13:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you mean？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.55,1:13:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know what it's like to see ghosts that don't go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.79,1:13:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,To be watching a scary movie in your head，whether you want to or not.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.36,1:13:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watching it alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.76,1:13:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ghosts are tough。You can't shoot ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.80,1:13:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can't arrest ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.77,1:13:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,But the best way to stop being haunted is to be with people.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.67,1:13:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're here，you're not hiding。You've done the right thing，Miss Prescott.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.12,1:13:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,What did you know about your mother？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.69,1:13:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,I always thought I had the perfect mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.93,1:13:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perfect family.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.93,1:13:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Till I found out I was wrong。She，um…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.24,1:14:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,She had a secret life，and I tried to understand that，and，um，
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.51,1:14:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,soon as I thought that I had，more secrets.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.32,1:14:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know who my mom was.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.45,1:14:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know who she was to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.86,1:14:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.13,1:14:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm off to search the set。I think what you saw is real.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.07,1:14:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the good news.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.03,1:14:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,How is that good news？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.94,1:14:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because that means we're dealing with an ordinary fleshandblood killer.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.51,1:14:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know how to handle guys like that。Oh，yeah？How？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.18,1:14:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Catch him… or kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.42,1:14:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Detective.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.79,1:14:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's your favorite scary movie？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.16,1:14:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,My life.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.20,1:15:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mine too.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.54,1:15:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have to think。Strategize.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.54,1:15:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Milton's the key to everything。He's a pervert，he's not a killer.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.57,1:15:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's gotta be involved somehow。We should follow him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.54,1:15:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna go back to the precinct and tell Kincaid and Sidney what we found out.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.68,1:15:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,My Gale would be much more aggressive.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.48,1:15:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,My Gale would suspect everybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.48,1:15:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,My Gale would… Shut up！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.72,1:15:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Riley here。Dewey，it's Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.59,1:15:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Sid。I'm with Gale。We're on our way to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.15,1:15:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.83,1:15:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，I'm not at the station.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.03,1:15:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,John Milton called me and said he had something to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.40,1:15:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Something about my mom。I'm going to meet him at his house.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.93,1:15:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，Sid，I'm not so sure that's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.34,1:15:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay。Kincaid's with me。I've got official bigtime…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.47,1:15:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,L.A.P.D。protection，but I'd feel better if you were there.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.98,1:15:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're on our way，but still，Sid… Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.95,1:15:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.08,1:15:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looks like we're going to that party after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.80,1:16:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，guys。Come on in。Join the party.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.20,1:16:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，well，actually，we're here to see Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.10,1:16:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？Sidney's here。Where？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.40,1:16:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's Sidney？She's right there！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.84,1:16:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus！Not 「Sidney，」Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.34,1:16:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like I'm 「Gale」 and she's Gale.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.65,1:16:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney Prescott？Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.78,1:16:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I'd never invite her here。She's on her way.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.98,1:16:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，the more the merrier.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.22,1:16:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,God，this house is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.72,1:16:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's old Hollywood.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.73,1:16:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，could the dude have more money？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.89,1:16:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Supposedly，Milton has a secret screening room…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.43,1:16:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,that was like the scene back in the '70s，you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.90,1:16:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was，like，drinks and drugs，and girls，and movies and shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.47,1:16:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow！Wish I could've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.04,1:16:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Big old screening room shouldn't be too hard to find。I'm gonna go check this place out.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.64,1:16:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa！Just one damn minute。There's a psycho killer on the loose.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.25,1:17:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you want to go traipsing around this gigantic mansion？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.98,1:17:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you ever actually seen the Stab movies？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.52,1:17:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Every time this dude enters a room，he ends up a goddamn shish kebab.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.32,1:17:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll go with you，Roman。There you go。You guys wanna come？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.59,1:17:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,It'll be okay。We're gonna stick together.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.36,1:17:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not stickin'。Wait up。We're gonna stay here and wait for Sid.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.13,1:17:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll be right back！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.87,1:17:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,If，if you were a screening room，
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.24,1:17:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,where would you be？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.05,1:17:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I bet in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.18,1:17:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't like basements.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.16,1:17:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ooh，it's spooky.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.74,1:17:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ooh，Weredad。Damn，it's dark in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.97,1:17:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I loved that movie.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.02,1:17:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forget the movie！What if Milton's crazy，
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.98,1:18:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,and he's gonna Jump outta his screening room with a sling blade or something？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.51,1:18:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,He won't。You sure about that？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.35,1:18:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's down there？Zombies and aliens.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.26,1:18:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，what you look like without makeup，Jennifer.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.36,1:18:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop pretending I wasn't the best you've ever had.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.04,1:18:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop pretending I even remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.23,1:18:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop pretending！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.97,1:18:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roman？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.22,1:18:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roman？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.16,1:18:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any sign of her？No.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.73,1:18:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is so strange.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.40,1:18:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,It sure is.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.40,1:19:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you have caller I.D。on your cell phone？Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.97,1:19:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Use it and press 「send.」
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.08,1:19:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.96,1:19:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is this thing？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.23,1:19:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is this what he…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.97,1:19:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hell…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.04,1:19:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey，he's got our voices.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.61,1:19:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's got Sid's.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.74,1:19:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's got us all.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.78,1:19:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God。We gotta find her。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.65,1:19:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，take the gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.65,1:19:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go find Roman and Jennifer。I'm gonna get the others.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.79,1:19:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be careful。You too.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.46,1:20:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tyson！Angelina！You up there？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.10,1:20:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roman！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.10,1:20:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tyson！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.20,1:20:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Angelina！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.61,1:20:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn it！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.61,1:20:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aah！Okay，come on。We gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.91,1:20:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's Angelina？I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.91,1:20:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,She went in here，I came in after her，now she's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.07,1:20:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.58,1:20:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's wrong？Looks like Stab 3 is back in production.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.22,1:20:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roman！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.09,1:20:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jennifer！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.67,1:20:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jennifer！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.41,1:20:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roman！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.68,1:20:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jennifer！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.23,1:21:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roman？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.55,1:21:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is he dead？Yeah，very.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.85,1:21:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey！Dewey！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.29,1:21:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.36,1:21:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.70,1:21:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,God，I'm sorry。Look，I found a secret passage.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.73,1:21:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roman's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.23,1:21:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？What？The killer's here。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.94,1:21:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let go of me！I'm getting out of here！You're not safe alone！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.67,1:21:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen to me！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.74,1:21:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I did not fuck that pig Milton
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.28,1:21:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,to get a leading role just to die here
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.89,1:22:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,with secondrate celebrities like you two！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.42,1:22:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale！I'm up here。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.93,1:22:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey！You guys should get out too.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.56,1:22:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's crazy to still be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.80,1:22:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.20,1:22:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.79,1:22:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale，Jennifer，up here。Dewey，here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.66,1:22:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,He got Roman and Angelina too.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.33,1:22:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll be safer if we stick together，won't we？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.37,1:22:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course。Why…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.17,1:22:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's goin' on？Oh，shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.00,1:22:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Dewey！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.41,1:23:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.58,1:23:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.69,1:23:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Police！Help！Help！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.13,1:23:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Police！Help！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.04,1:23:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，you motherfucker！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.58,1:24:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.88,1:24:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey！Dewey！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.02,1:24:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Behind the mirror，Dewey！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.73,1:24:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale！Get away！Dewey！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.53,1:24:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you hear something？Get away from me，you asshole。You don't scare me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.97,1:24:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，Gale。The mirror's moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.91,1:24:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale！Gale！Stand back，Gale.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.48,1:24:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't kill me。I'm the killer in Stab 3。I'm the killer！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.85,1:24:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale，cover！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.65,1:24:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.36,1:25:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tyson！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.07,1:25:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tyson！I'm gonna check down here。You call for help.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.14,1:25:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.74,1:25:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tyson！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.87,1:25:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tyson？Any sign of him？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.65,1:25:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。All right。I'm gonna check out front.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.99,1:25:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dew…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.28,1:25:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.75,1:25:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.16,1:26:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.63,1:26:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.23,1:26:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.43,1:26:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.34,1:26:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who is this？Dewey，it's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.14,1:26:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale… where are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.28,1:26:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm in the basement。I'm trapped。Where？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.45,1:26:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a door in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.65,1:26:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.66,1:26:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait。How do I know this is you，Gale，and not the killer？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.60,1:26:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey，open the fucking door。It's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.37,1:26:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，don't you think that's what the killer would say？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.24,1:26:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。He's out cold… at the bottom of the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.21,1:26:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.42,1:27:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey。Dewey.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.17,1:27:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，all right。It's pizza，not a party.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.64,1:27:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everybody get back to work。Anybody seen my fucking partner？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.44,1:27:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Morgan，what did you say？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.70,1:28:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？Hello？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.13,1:28:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who is this？Who is this？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.80,1:28:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Um，who's calling？Um，who's calling？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.94,1:28:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale，Dewey，whoever，call me back.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.26,1:28:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can only hear myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.68,1:28:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I only hear you too，Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.35,1:28:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who is this？The question isn't who I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.89,1:28:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,The question is：Who's with me？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.36,1:28:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney，stay away！Sidney！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.66,1:28:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't do it。If you do one thing to attract attention to yourself，
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.60,1:28:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,one thing，I'll kill them both.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.63,1:29:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，do you have somewhere we can be alone？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.17,1:29:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。Yeah。Go there.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.48,1:29:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，it's hard being friends with you，Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.68,1:29:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,When you're friends with Sidney，you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.99,1:29:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，these friends don't have to，Sidney。It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.46,1:29:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do I know their voices are… Are real？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.73,1:29:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you know you're not hearing things？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.80,1:29:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you know I'm not someone in your head？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.70,1:29:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Somewhere you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.97,1:29:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't come here，Sidney！Dewey！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.01,1:29:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or do you？You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.14,1:29:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want them。I want you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.61,1:29:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's simple。You show yourself，they survive.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.06,1:29:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,You run，they die.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.58,1:29:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.62,1:29:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you wanna know，Sidney，who killed her？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.35,1:29:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you wanna know who killed your mother？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.79,1:29:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seen Kincaid？Yeah，I saw him go out.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.39,1:29:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.03,1:30:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,She'd have been so happy，Sidney，to know we'd be together.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.03,1:30:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where？I'll call you when you're on your way.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.51,1:30:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit。Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.51,1:30:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.21,1:31:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.46,1:31:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？You follow directions well，Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.16,1:31:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，welcome to the final act.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.53,1:31:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,See that metal detector？Use it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.94,1:31:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,All over，Sidney。Everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.65,1:32:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everywhere。The other leg too.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.69,1:32:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Show it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.09,1:32:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Throw it in the pool.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.73,1:32:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，come inside，Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.80,1:32:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,No fucking way。How do I know they're not dead already？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.97,1:32:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're right inside，waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.48,1:32:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.82,1:32:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now that we're all here，the party can begin.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.09,1:32:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey。Sid.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.60,1:32:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is he？I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.73,1:32:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's right there！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.48,1:33:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.78,1:33:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Think again.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.05,1:33:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's your turn to scream，asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.82,1:33:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.29,1:33:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay。Just give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.40,1:33:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Hurry，Sid.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.00,1:33:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.67,1:33:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is he？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.01,1:33:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be careful！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.19,1:33:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I heard shots。Tyson's dead。What's goin' on？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.86,1:33:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,What're you doin' here，Kincaid？Lookin'for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.66,1:33:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tyson said there was a party here tonight，and I thought，「Uhoh.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.83,1:33:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Third act celebration.「 Thought I better check it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.10,1:33:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alone？Where's your partner？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.24,1:34:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Miss Prescott.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.47,1:34:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm here to help。Put the gun down.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.08,1:34:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put the gun down.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.25,1:34:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.89,1:34:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid！Wake up，Sid！Sid，come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.83,1:34:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wake up！Sidney！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.53,1:34:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shoot him，Sid。Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.50,1:34:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid。Shoot the fucker！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.21,1:34:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shoot him！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.72,1:34:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want me，motherfucker？Come and get me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.92,1:34:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Run！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.64,1:35:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.87,1:35:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.51,1:35:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come in here… please.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.95,1:35:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's Just me，Sid.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.19,1:36:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，I was so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.56,1:36:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everybody loved me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.66,1:36:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you missed me，Sidney？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.67,1:36:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would you like to hold me one last time？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.94,1:36:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's the matter？What are you staring at？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.74,1:36:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you remember your… Mother？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.59,1:36:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not going anywhere，Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.39,1:36:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's time you came to terms with me and with Mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.63,1:36:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe you never knew her at all，Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.64,1:36:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe you Just can't get past the surface of things.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.24,1:36:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you？The other half of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.35,1:37:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I searched for a mother too，an actress named Rina Reynolds.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.12,1:37:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tried to find her my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.22,1:37:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,And four years ago，I actually tracked her down.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.12,1:37:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Knocked at her door，thinking she'd welcome me with open arms，
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.96,1:37:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,but she had a new life
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.36,1:37:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,and a new name：Maureen Prescott.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.23,1:37:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were the only child she claimed，Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.27,1:37:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,She shut me out in the cold forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.33,1:37:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Her own son.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.74,1:37:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roman Bridger，director。And brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.78,1:37:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,She slammed the door in my face.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.11,1:37:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,She said I was Rina's child，and Rina was dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.02,1:37:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,And it struck me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.16,1:37:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,What a good idea！So I watched her.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.93,1:37:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I made a little home movie.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.33,1:37:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,A little family film.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.70,1:37:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,It seems Maureen… Mom…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.17,1:37:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,She really got around。I mean，Cotton was one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.04,1:37:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everybody knew about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.41,1:38:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,But Billy's father？That was the key.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.74,1:38:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your boyfriend didn't like seeing his daddy in my film too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.57,1:38:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,He didn't like it at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.98,1:38:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,But once I supplied the motivation，
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.00,1:38:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,all the kid needed was a few pointers.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.65,1:38:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have a partner to sell out in case you get caught，find someone to frame.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.56,1:38:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was like he was making a movie.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.49,1:38:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,You。This is all because of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.86,1:38:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a director，Sid.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.53,1:38:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I direct。Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.74,1:38:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had no idea… they were gonna make a film of their own.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.84,1:38:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,What a film it turned out to be，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.71,1:38:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，introducing Sidney，the victim.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.25,1:38:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney，the survivor。Sidney，the star！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.77,1:39:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。All right。You're gonna be all right。Just apply pressure.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.37,1:39:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here，take this。Get the son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.91,1:39:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.64,1:39:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fine，you got what you wanted，hero and villain facetoface.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.91,1:39:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what happens now？The villain dies！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.29,1:39:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Exactly！But，
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.45,1:39:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not the villain，Sid，you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.22,1:39:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here he is，the man who gave away your mother's innocence.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.79,1:39:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Huh？What he did to her made her a slut.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.36,1:39:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Didn't it？Huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.36,1:39:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,She never recovered from that night，right here in this room.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.86,1:39:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,They fucked her three ways from Sunday。Ruined her life.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.03,1:39:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ruined yours too，didn't it，Sid？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.47,1:39:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,You hate him，Sid？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.61,1:39:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，I know you do。I'm sure you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.61,1:39:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.61,1:39:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know what happened to my mother，and understand，
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.68,1:39:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make you pay！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.92,1:39:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what the police are gonna find on Milton's answering machine…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.72,1:39:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,right next to his lifeless，mutilated corpse.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.06,1:39:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？Can't hear ya.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.79,1:39:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't have to do this。Just tell me what you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.99,1:39:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can make it happen。Any picture.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.37,1:40:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Name your budget。Script approval.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.06,1:40:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Final cut！I already have it.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.43,1:40:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.47,1:40:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,God！You spineless bastard！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.60,1:40:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Sid，that would be you。You did it all.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.64,1:40:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,You did it，you called them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.21,1:40:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Even your closest… friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.98,1:40:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Living in total isolation，the pressure of another movie about you，
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.85,1:40:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,the discovery that Milton destroyed Mommy dearest，
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.78,1:40:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,you finally just snapped！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.02,1:40:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,One，two，three！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.43,1:40:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,And who's our hero，huh？The sole survivor.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.36,1:40:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's the one who bravely faced down the psychopath and
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.84,1:40:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,killed her with her own knife？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.77,1:40:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for the life you stole from me，Sid.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.87,1:40:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,For the mother，and for the family，and for the stardom and…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.87,1:40:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Goddamn it！Everything you have that should've been mine！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.24,1:40:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't you stop your whining and get on with it？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.24,1:40:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've heard this shit before！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.48,1:40:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.94,1:40:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know why you kill people，Roman？Do you？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.95,1:40:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't wanna hear it！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.87,1:40:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,'Cause you choose to！There is no one else to blame！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.15,1:40:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop！Fucking damn it！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.92,1:41:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't you take some fucking responsibility？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.62,1:41:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck you！Fuck you！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.57,1:41:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid？Sidney？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.18,1:41:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.73,1:41:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.94,1:41:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.55,1:42:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Leave her alone！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.53,1:42:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey，do something！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.70,1:42:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stand back！Dewey！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.37,1:42:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.81,1:42:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.53,1:42:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.87,1:43:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is he？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.86,1:43:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.46,1:43:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lose something？Found something.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.62,1:43:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's gotta be another way in there！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.09,1:43:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,You hurt her，I swear I'll kill you！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.04,1:44:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.01,1:44:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Down this way。There's another hallway.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.43,1:44:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's another door down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.37,1:44:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,This thing's not budging.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.84,1:44:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look around for something heavy。Go that way。Okay！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.13,1:45:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I shot you.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.41,1:45:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess we think alike.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.61,1:45:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mother's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.15,1:45:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,And there is nothing you can do about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.65,1:45:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I still got to make my movie.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.89,1:45:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stab 3，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.34,1:45:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kincaid，hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.75,1:45:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roman？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.75,1:45:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was Roman？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.94,1:46:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be careful，Sid。Randy said the killer's always superhuman.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.15,1:46:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，well，he wasn't superhuman，Dewey.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.75,1:46:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,He wasn't superhuman at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.39,1:46:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't fuckin' kill me！Head！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.70,1:46:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Head！Head，Dewey！What？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.17,1:46:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Head！Shoot him in the head.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.51,1:47:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.42,1:47:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.49,1:47:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.88,1:47:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.85,1:47:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Cherokee。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.18,1:47:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，she's doin'great。Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.59,1:47:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.19,1:47:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing with that？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.56,1:47:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Um，will you sign it for me，Gale？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.20,1:47:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,You hate that book.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.04,1:47:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Besides，I'm done with that kind of reporting.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.44,1:48:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,For me。Will you sign it for me？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.35,1:48:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a nut.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.45,1:48:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mmm。Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.23,1:48:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you？Dewey.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.80,1:48:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know it'll never work，and you know it'll never work.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.30,1:48:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，what I'm asking is… just to see if we're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.91,1:48:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't know everything，Gale.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.68,1:48:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，you think you do，but…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.43,1:48:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a brave man，Dewey Riley.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.43,1:48:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm really scared right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.61,1:49:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.22,1:49:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid，we've been waiting for you。We're gonna start a movie.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.89,1:49:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,What kind of movie？You have to come and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里发生一宗连环车祸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.21,0:00:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,劝大家走别的路
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.51,0:00:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,建议刚好正在前往的路上朋友换一条路线
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.51,0:00:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们迟些再谈 现在我要工作
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.95,0:00:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果丹不想按月薪来的话 那就算周薪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.45,0:00:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但低于一百万我可不干
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.55,0:00:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我想一想 如果我接受这个角色的话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.66,0:00:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就等于是让我这个全国首屈一指的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.82,0:00:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱口秀节目主持人去拍一部廉价的恐怖电影
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.83,0:00:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就不能给我一个好一点的角色？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.16,0:00:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够了这倒霉事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.57,0:00:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 你和凯蒂谈过那海豹特种部队的剧本了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.64,0:00:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好？你好？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.44,0:00:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁？你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.91,0:01:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找谁？你知道吗？很抱歉 我打错了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.68,0:01:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 等等 你的声音很熟悉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.29,0:01:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的声音像电视上那个 嗯… 卡顿·威瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.39,0:01:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？是的 我认为他的声音很性感
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.36,0:01:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你就是卡顿 对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.77,0:01:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊我正在和卡顿·威瑞说话 真难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.34,0:01:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真有意思 我手头还有个电话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.81,0:01:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能等等吗 我很快就好 我保证
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.04,0:01:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德鲁 我稍后打给你 有人找我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.69,0:01:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了！你是百分百的卡顿粉丝？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.06,0:01:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的！百分之一百一十 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.80,0:01:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 为什么不告诉我你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.80,0:01:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！你真顽皮 你的女朋友会怎么想呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.87,0:02:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会认为我有女朋友？我知道你有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.51,0:02:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在她的浴室外面 你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.21,0:02:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她正在洗澡 嗓音很甜美
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.42,0:02:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道她的样子怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.49,0:02:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很漂亮 卡顿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.66,0:02:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,比莫琳·普莱斯柯特漂亮多了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.09,0:02:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,讲着话时 让我们来玩个游戏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.56,0:02:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,答对了 你女朋友就能活下来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.97,0:02:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,答错了 她就要死
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.20,0:02:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫琳的女儿西德妮在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.30,0:02:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的是哪个东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.62,0:02:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个死也要知道西德妮·普莱斯柯特在哪的人！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.01,0:02:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,机会只有一次 卡顿！你现在得到了 她在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.81,0:02:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你个该死的神经病你敢碰克里斯汀娜一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.50,0:02:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓我会杀了你！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.68,0:02:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答错误！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！等等！喂？该死！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.66,0:02:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！快滚开！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.58,0:02:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你差点撞上我！滚开！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.52,0:03:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯汀娜 在的话快接电话啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.79,0:03:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯汀娜 接电话啊！哦 该死！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.52,0:03:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好这里是911 由于当前来电过多…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.92,0:03:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的 快来个人接电话啊！滚开！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.43,0:04:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.95,0:04:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡顿 是你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.79,0:04:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡顿？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.06,0:04:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.38,0:04:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 卡顿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.03,0:05:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我不喜欢你的杀戮游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.90,0:05:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？谁在那？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.60,0:05:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯汀娜？亲爱的 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.87,0:05:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了 老天！你把我吓坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.30,0:05:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定不会相信今天我遇上什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.95,0:05:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.99,0:05:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出去！好了 对不起 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.23,0:05:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是有意要把你吓成那样的 是我 好了 开门吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.20,0:05:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？你他妈的在干什么？什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.97,0:05:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在玩一下升级版的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.77,0:05:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 好了 开门吧 克里斯 游戏？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.04,0:05:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 游戏而已！你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.75,0:05:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说的是把你的内脏给撕出来是多有意思的事啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.85,0:06:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 打开这该死的门 克里斯汀娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.98,0:06:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.09,0:06:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我会让你变成历史 宝贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.41,0:06:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯汀娜？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.44,0:06:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.35,0:06:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛杉矶交通情况最新报道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.29,0:06:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,无辜的驾驶员们既愤怒又不安 克里斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.52,0:06:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就快被这高速路上的状况搞疯了 别玩了 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.79,0:06:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要让他们面对他们的受害者 来个面对面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.00,0:06:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在百分百卡顿的节目上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.93,0:06:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,高速路上的惨剧 记住这也可能会发生在你身上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天的百分百卡顿！道路狂飙现象
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.51,0:07:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛杉矶驾驶员们的反击
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.64,0:07:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来六号频道将播出的是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.31,0:07:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们独家带来的现场报道…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.35,0:07:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一部电影的好莱坞首映仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.58,0:07:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.74,0:07:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 该死
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.23,0:07:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.36,0:07:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你吗 宝贝？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.40,0:08:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯 如果你在里面就快开门 好吗 宝贝？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.70,0:08:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯？快 宝贝 来开门
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.35,0:08:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯 哇 哇 哇 天啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.88,0:08:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 克里斯 你要干吗？离我远点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.32,0:08:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我远点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.12,0:08:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯 出什么事了 宝贝？你疯了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.53,0:08:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯 屋子里还有别人吗？没有！退后！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.83,0:08:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 好 冷静一点 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.83,0:08:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么想杀我？你在说什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.53,0:08:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么想杀我？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.86,0:08:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,把球棍给我 好吗？把球棍给我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.94,0:08:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你 把球棍给我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.51,0:08:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！克里斯 快闪开！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.01,0:08:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心后面！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.49,0:08:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.51,0:09:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个游戏很简单 只要你告诉我西德妮在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.38,0:09:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你输了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.68,0:09:25.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《惊声尖叫3》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.30,0:09:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.19,0:09:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 切罗基 这边
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.16,0:10:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.08,0:10:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 切罗基
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.40,0:10:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,加州女性生活危机辅导
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.40,0:10:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我是蒙特瑞的罗拉 能帮我接入吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.50,0:10:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 谢谢 罗拉 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.94,0:10:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,加州女性生活危机辅导
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.84,0:10:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么能帮你的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.17,0:10:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我能不说自己的名字吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.01,0:11:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以 你不想说的可以不说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.58,0:11:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么能帮你的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.58,0:11:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今年18岁 有一个男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.89,0:11:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他经常会殴打我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.12,0:11:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 你可以和我说 好吗？谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.86,0:11:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 在演讲的最后 最为美国未来的媒体人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.90,0:11:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一件事你们必须要记住
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.57,0:11:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃得苦中苦 方为人上人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.17,0:11:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,打破陈规 无所畏惧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.04,0:11:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,承受住整个社会的怨气
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.62,0:11:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这样你们才能得到出有价值的新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.14,0:11:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,报道和声誉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.85,0:11:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.85,0:11:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 抱歉 什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.35,0:11:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你的意思就是我们应该准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.81,0:11:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,走向社会与他人进行冷酷的竞争…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.56,0:11:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你就是这么做的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.02,0:11:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐晦的来说 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.99,0:11:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你告诉我 韦瑟斯女士这么做有多大的意义呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.93,0:11:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我们的时间到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.37,0:11:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔·韦瑟斯 百分百娱乐的新闻女主播
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.67,0:11:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你带来的演说！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.34,0:12:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有个年轻人想见你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.91,0:12:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他是警察 警察？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.85,0:12:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是洛杉矶警方的马克·金凯德警长 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.30,0:12:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个令人印象深刻的简历
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.56,0:12:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 不过我想你不是来这儿要签名的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.89,0:12:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这儿是因为卡顿·威瑞的谋杀案
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.51,0:12:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡顿被人杀了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.47,0:12:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起遇难的还有他的女友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.74,0:12:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手故意给我们留下了一些信息
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.50,0:12:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你看是因为你是伍兹伯勒时间的当事人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.66,0:12:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你也认识这个人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.71,0:12:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我要告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.77,0:12:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你把这个信息泄漏出去 你将会被捕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.24,0:12:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以即将赢得普利策新闻奖的职业操守发誓 警长
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.45,0:12:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是在卡顿·威瑞尸体边发现的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.00,0:12:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识这个女孩吗？哦 天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.85,0:12:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是莫琳·普莱斯柯特
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.54,0:12:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮·普莱斯柯特的妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.46,0:12:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好莱坞被一名
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.66,0:12:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,饱受争议的脱口秀节目主持人卡顿·威瑞的死震惊了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.23,0:12:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,威瑞刚刚完成了一部自己参与拍摄的一部名叫
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.97,0:12:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀戮3 影片回到伍兹伯勒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.90,0:13:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是这个著名的恐怖系列的第3部也是最后一部
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.70,0:13:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,电影根据伍兹伯勒和温莎大学的凶杀案改编而来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.41,0:13:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他进入电视界之前 卡顿曾经被捕
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.38,0:13:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但随后就被解除了谋杀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.69,0:13:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的前女友莫琳·普莱斯柯特的罪名…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.39,0:13:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在昨天
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.43,0:13:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡顿·威瑞还在升阳电影公司这里拍摄电影
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.20,0:13:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的影视荧幕首秀 杀戮3
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.60,0:13:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前这里现场保护森严
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.10,0:13:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们是否能套到一些消息 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.37,0:13:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个饱受争议的公众人物…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.37,0:13:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,第8频道新闻节目我们得进去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.54,0:13:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都不能进去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.92,0:13:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你担心这部影片 那就做好保卫工作
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.79,0:13:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,多请些保安 请些国民警卫队 不要让这部影片流产
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.99,0:14:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,电影拍摄过程中出现凶杀案是件大事 罗曼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是这部影片想见到的宣传效应
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.43,0:14:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 如果我们不做恐怖电影
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.06,0:14:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 那些变态杀手就不会出现了？得了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.47,0:14:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了30年的恐怖电影
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.78,0:14:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没遇到过变态杀手这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.20,0:14:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你找来的该死的演员
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.73,0:14:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个结了婚的脱口秀主持人？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.53,0:14:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定每天都得罪很多人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.38,0:14:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长 卡顿的死…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.95,0:14:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,和这部电影没什么关系 对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.28,0:14:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他接拍了一部电影叫杀戮 结果他就被杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.19,0:14:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许有些精神病影迷因为杀戮2里面兰迪的死而恼火
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.13,0:14:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰森 那你就会是下一个目标 不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.23,0:14:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是兰迪第二 我有自己的特点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.23,0:14:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,名叫瑞奇 在音像店工作 这是个荣耀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.84,0:14:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！如果凶手是西德妮·普莱斯柯特呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.37,0:14:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是想说 她到底有着怎样的遭遇？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.91,0:14:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可能就像大学炸弹客一样生活在森林里 伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.25,0:14:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始明白为什么托莉·史培林
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.83,0:14:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,和大卫·修蒙为什么不愿回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.48,0:14:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 这只是针对卡顿的 我们没有危险
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.82,0:15:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我们没有危险」 卡迪说的 剧本第15页
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.99,0:15:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没见你打算离开
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.86,0:15:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！你觉得我这个年龄的黑人演员
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.42,0:15:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,能就这样丢掉工作吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.13,0:15:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这是笔生意
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.22,0:15:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们召我这样的演员去非主流的戏剧院做迎宾员
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.20,0:15:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,LL CoolJ乐队像莎士比亚一样在公园卖艺
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.47,0:15:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.21,0:15:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这不该发生 不该发生？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.58,0:15:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是寻找新任西德妮选秀的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.58,0:15:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从5万个女孩中被挑选出来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.01,0:15:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该祈祷这部影片不要流产
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.35,0:15:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然我是该这么想 但是我不想有任何人牺牲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.22,0:15:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 可爱的小提琴 对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.89,0:15:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.43,0:15:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.37,0:15:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,德嘉的咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.88,0:15:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要这一块清场拜托 清场了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.98,0:16:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔·韦瑟斯！哦 天啊！该死！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.85,0:16:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,看呐 我知道我们从没见过
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.95,0:16:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不介意你从没回过我的电话 但我必须要告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.46,0:16:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在两部电影之后 我觉得你对我应该有印象
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.96,0:16:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这应该就能解释我最近为什么老是头疼了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.06,0:16:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我对60分钟II这个节目的事感到很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.10,0:16:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是对百分百娱乐来说 那是一个很好的后备计划
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.28,0:16:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.54,0:16:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉和布拉德·皮特合作的计划黄了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.85,0:16:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是单飞也是个不错的后备计划
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.64,0:16:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,给了我更多的时间处理公务
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.28,0:16:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到底 盖尔·韦瑟斯 你是一个性格复杂的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.08,0:16:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 现在却被这样一位心胸广阔的人来扮演
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.78,0:16:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 珍妮弗 尼基说你想…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.35,0:16:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.36,0:16:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.26,0:16:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 惊喜啊惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.26,0:16:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人死了但是盖尔却开始活跃起来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.07,0:16:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔 我想你会对我个性化的表演而感到欣慰的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.54,0:16:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,某人正帮助我去认识一个真正的你 某人？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.34,0:17:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的无情野心 你的自怨自艾
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.85,0:17:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那内在的迷茫孤独的女儿心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.11,0:17:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么可迷茫孤独的？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.18,0:17:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经听清楚了 谢谢 杜威 稍后还给你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.15,0:17:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么可迷茫孤独的？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.16,0:17:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,小女人的心思
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.49,0:17:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你该在伍兹伯勒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.59,0:17:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我很吃惊你还会想到我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.76,0:17:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得回去工作了 没时间应酬你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.47,0:17:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你在这儿工作？是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.77,0:17:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,电影需要一名技术顾问
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.90,0:17:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人想经历真实的场景 了解真实的当事人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.47,0:17:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 杜威 嘿 汤姆
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.71,0:17:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！这真是盖尔·韦瑟斯本人 如假包换
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.35,0:17:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆·普林斯 经常看你的节目
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.75,0:17:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 二十一世纪的流行文化是政治
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.56,0:17:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.76,0:17:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,上个月的车祸事故报道也是你做的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.79,0:17:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦 那是件大事 对 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.20,0:17:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我特别欣赏的就是你隐隐揭露了事故
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.23,0:17:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是由酗酒和嗑药引起的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.57,0:18:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那个车胎爆裂是造假的 真是大快人心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.77,0:18:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆 有时候新闻报道你必须…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.54,0:18:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的车停在停车场吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.54,0:18:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去检查一下确保没人把你的刹车线给剪断了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.05,0:18:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他干什么的？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.68,0:18:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他扮演你？就他？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.62,0:18:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.83,0:18:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是来和你吵架的 杜威
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.16,0:18:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死卡顿的凶手留下一张照片
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.19,0:18:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是西德妮妈妈的 警长告诉我的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.17,0:18:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,死的你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.53,0:18:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 西德妮不想你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.04,0:18:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你的长枪短炮去打扰她的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.24,0:18:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哪只眼睛看到摄像机了？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.07,0:18:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.28,0:18:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我买了这个钱包 是不是？是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.81,0:18:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个习惯 我步行离开家时 我打开它时…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.32,0:18:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么回事？盖尔·韦瑟斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.42,0:18:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能更加受欢迎点吗？没有新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.92,0:18:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿没什么新闻 把那女人给我拖出去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.62,0:18:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 米尔顿先生 走 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.62,0:19:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,金凯德警长在哪？我和金凯德在合作 杜威
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.16,0:19:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有规矩 不成方圆 盖尔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.16,0:19:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 说实话 见到你很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.80,0:19:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀戮3是这个系列的最后一部
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.77,0:19:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是前面将要看到的就是古老的辛菲尔德舞台
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.51,0:19:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 有人想要上厕所吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.77,0:19:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我要 是的 我也要去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.41,0:19:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我自己走！谢谢你们 弟兄们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.25,0:19:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 沉默的鲍勃
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.43,0:19:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是最近挺红的新闻女主播 该死的康妮钟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.02,0:19:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 康妮 莫瑞怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.66,0:19:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 我觉得她喜欢我 你发觉她看我的眼神了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.16,0:19:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情又发生了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.33,0:19:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡顿树敌不少 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.77,0:19:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方也没说这事和我们有关
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.17,0:19:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在想她？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.58,0:19:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你母亲？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.61,0:19:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她当初没有… 这些事就都不会发生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.78,0:19:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她没有…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.39,0:20:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么她有这么多秘密 爸爸？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.39,0:20:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 也许你是时候回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.69,0:20:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很担心你 孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.98,0:20:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,独自一人在外 从不和任何人接触
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.23,0:20:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一能和你说话的人甚至都不知道你的真名
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.24,0:20:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就好像你根本不存在于这世上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.44,0:20:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样才好 变态杀手根本杀不了他们找不到的人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.62,0:21:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.59,0:21:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈想和你说话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.83,0:21:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 所有你触碰过的东西 都将凋零！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.63,0:21:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是毒药 就和我一样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.54,0:21:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我一样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.67,0:22:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊！他们对我做了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.15,0:22:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会对你下手的 他们会对你下手的 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.37,0:22:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.70,0:23:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.21,0:23:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀戮3
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.21,0:23:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊我得找个新经理人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.18,0:23:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.49,0:23:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.20,0:23:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯坦 我朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.40,0:23:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他干的不错 不是吗？谢谢 非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.37,0:23:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠你妈的 泰森 去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.71,0:23:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 莎拉 我们在化妆测试
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.58,0:23:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 化妆 你正合适这样 你见过罗曼吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.01,0:23:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,办公室所有人都下班回家了 他说这很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.88,0:23:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,对罗曼来说什么事都很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.11,0:24:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 该死！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.95,0:24:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.32,0:24:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,总监室 莎拉 是罗曼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.09,0:24:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我恐怕要迟到一小会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.44,0:24:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在405 大概10分钟后到
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.99,0:24:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 没关系 我只是在看你的唱片大奖的奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.77,0:24:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然和你联系上了 我们来谈谈你的角色 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.97,0:24:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么角色？我饰演卡迪 第二个被杀的小人物
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.00,0:24:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在两个场景里过过场
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.01,0:24:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你似乎对自己的安排感到不满
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.08,0:24:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不满意的是35岁的我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.92,0:24:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,要去扮演一个21岁的小青年
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.18,0:24:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不满意我要全身赤裸的死去
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.32,0:24:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我不满意的是我饰演的角色
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.79,0:24:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,在她的男友被砍成鱼饼之后…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.45,0:25:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,愚蠢的在家里放了把枪 是的 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.55,0:25:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 好了 我们来谈具体的台词
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.22,0:25:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.59,0:25:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,28页 卡迪的重要时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.20,0:25:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,28页
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.97,0:25:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,叮铃铃 你好？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.57,0:25:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好？哪位？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.37,0:25:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是哪位？我是卡迪
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.58,0:25:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等 我穿件衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.71,0:25:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见了？我不明白我为什么要从浴室的场景开拍
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.85,0:25:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,澡都洗完了 晕了吗 喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.65,0:25:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 我的男朋友刚刚死去 我洗什么澡啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.19,0:25:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么不投入到场景中去呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.43,0:25:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡迪 很不错的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.40,0:25:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是像蔗糖或是涂了太妃糖苹果？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.66,0:25:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.10,0:25:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.54,0:25:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你打错电话了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.11,0:25:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道我最喜欢的名字？我挂电话了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.74,0:25:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是莎拉
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.74,0:25:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼 台词不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.38,0:26:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的剧本里有
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.98,0:26:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有哪个该死编剧把剧本重写了？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.62,0:26:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,每15分钟就出一个新版的剧本我们还对个屁台词啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.16,0:26:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是一个新的剧本 这是一部新的电影
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.13,0:26:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？什么电影？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.26,0:26:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的电影
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.93,0:26:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,名字就叫莎拉像头死猪一样被串烧！该死
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.97,0:26:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续扮演… 莎拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.26,0:26:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.85,0:27:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎致电升阳电影公司
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.45,0:27:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想要今天的节目单 请按一
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.99,0:27:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,布雷吉先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.27,0:27:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想知道预告片或剧照放出的日期 请按四
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.11,0:27:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果想获取影视周边产品的信息 请按五 快 快
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.52,0:27:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果想联系警卫或者有什么紧急情况 请按六
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.53,0:27:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.71,0:28:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！该死！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.16,0:28:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我把话挑明了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.96,0:28:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我参与这件事纯粹是因为警方需要我的协助
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.63,0:28:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方为什么寻求你的帮助？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.93,0:28:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我写了一本关于伍兹伯勒谋杀案的权威书籍
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.17,0:28:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定你等不及要写另一本了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.14,0:28:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？我什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.98,0:28:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你不会离开伍兹伯勒
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.41,0:28:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,「唯一让你感觉真实的地方」
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.75,0:28:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你现在在这儿 却不是和我在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.59,0:28:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威 我照顾过你
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.69,0:28:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直等到你身体有所好转 但我不能待在那种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.62,0:28:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就像是狗年
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.43,0:28:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,伍兹伯勒一年发生的事就像别的地方七年发生的事
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.09,0:29:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就去巴黎一星期？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.03,0:29:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,去纽约一个月？永远待在洛杉矶？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.36,0:29:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为60分钟II这个节目我没理由拒绝
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.46,0:29:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我不可能成为下一个黛安·索耶
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.90,0:29:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就做回真正的盖尔·韦瑟斯有什么不好？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.45,0:29:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就喜欢这样的你
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.31,0:29:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能的 杜威
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.16,0:29:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们曾经试过 但我们是不同类型的人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.05,0:29:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前说那是我们的优点
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.62,0:29:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯… 咖啡来了 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.56,0:29:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威 你来这儿不只是为了能在二级市场
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.76,0:29:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是盗版小影院看见我 不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.90,0:29:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,省省吧 盖尔 我做这些事和你没任何关系
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.40,0:29:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有什么事 杜威？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.47,0:29:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道什么 是不是？不能记录？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.64,0:29:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.94,0:29:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个月前 伍兹伯勒警局接到一个女人的来电…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.88,0:29:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她自称是杀戮3剧组的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.88,0:29:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想看看西德妮的档案
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.30,0:29:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,说是为了「研究人物内心」 然后？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.59,0:30:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个接电话的同事说不行 那个女的也没留下姓名
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.89,0:30:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个月后 警局被人闯入
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.96,0:30:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,档案室被洗劫一空
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.36,0:30:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人偷了西德妮的档案？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.96,0:30:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就把它转存到别的地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.97,0:30:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为剧组里有人想找到西德妮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.00,0:30:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 这真是难以置信 我说了：「不得记录」
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.17,0:30:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.41,0:30:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是珍妮弗 她找我
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.42,0:30:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮弗？得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.48,0:30:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！杜威 你去哪？我在当值
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.20,0:30:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟着我
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.44,0:30:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在为警方工作 该死的！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.77,0:30:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可不是警察 你也不是 匿名先生
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.51,0:31:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 你的车还没熄火 该死
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.62,0:31:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,粉丝我能有很多粉丝粉丝们 想要照片
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.72,0:31:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想要和我交谈
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.19,0:31:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能有很多粉丝！你看到了 杜威？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.19,0:31:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一年半没得到过这种待遇了 有人必须为此负责
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.16,0:31:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮弗 冷静 出什么事了？我和他一起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.56,0:31:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 似乎我一直没赢过你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.73,0:31:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二起凶杀案发生了 谁遇害了？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.67,0:31:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉·达玲 在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.50,0:31:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,摄影棚 哪？南茜·德鲁想知道在哪！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.11,0:31:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡顿·威瑞 莎拉·达玲 难道你还不明白？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.38,0:31:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人要杀他们是应为他们在电影中就会死去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.82,0:31:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威 谁会是第三个死者？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.08,0:31:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会是第三个死者？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.59,0:31:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.07,0:32:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在杀戮3中会被杀？我会被杀？是的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.68,0:32:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威 你去哪？我去拖车里拿点东西
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.65,0:32:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和她一起住这儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.95,0:32:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 哦 天啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.85,0:32:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找个地方落脚 她说她喜欢我在她附近的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.35,0:32:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.36,0:32:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说我能让她感到安全感
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.76,0:32:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说我是她的后盾 她的后盾？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.83,0:32:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 如果你不是那么在意虚荣和外表
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.87,0:32:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就该欣赏我为一个女人所带去的乐观的精神和情绪
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.97,0:32:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯通 我直接去犯罪现场
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.08,0:32:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你待在珍妮弗的身边 建议你清查一下四周
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.88,0:32:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 杜威 能和你说两句吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.55,0:32:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,直说吧 我是一名职业的保安
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.99,0:32:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经保护过朱莉亚·罗伯茨
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.67,0:32:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞尔门·拉什迪 时髦辣妹组合
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.46,0:32:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是好莱坞演员的跟班
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.63,0:32:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你不是名真正的警察
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.86,0:32:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的简历听起来像讣告
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.87,0:33:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你听听我的意见怎么样？好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.97,0:33:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.67,0:33:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 同样的手法？在尸体边上找到？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.34,0:33:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 还是莫琳·普莱斯柯特 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.91,0:33:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,在发生十起凶杀案我们就能出本挂历了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.28,0:33:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,老套的「猫和老鼠」 游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.58,0:33:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,很像汉尼拔 很像七宗罪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.12,0:33:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些杀手不是冲着电影里的警察去的？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.46,0:33:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常有一个警察能逃出生天
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.53,0:33:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后？另一个下了地狱
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.96,0:33:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常来说
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.97,0:33:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,金凯德警长 我们有什么线索？同一个凶手？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.47,0:33:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 终极娱乐 这是犯罪现场明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.91,0:33:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,华莱士 韦瑟斯小姐目前协助我调查 谢谢 警长
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.14,0:33:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别客气 既然如此
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.14,0:33:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要追查灰尘上留下的简波利的指纹
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.95,0:33:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,照片 华莱士麻烦了？谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.55,0:33:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的照片 同一个人 你那边的调查有什么进展？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.12,0:33:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些东西毫无帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.56,0:33:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮弗身边的警察呢？她是剧本中第三个被杀的人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.53,0:34:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有个保镖 更何况 光剧本就有三个不同的版本
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.63,0:34:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎是为了防止影片的结尾提前在网上泄漏
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.75,0:34:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该知道
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.37,0:34:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是技术顾问 对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.37,0:34:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个版本 三个不同的角色接下去将面临死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.41,0:34:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且我们不知道凶手看的是哪种剧本
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.81,0:34:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.58,0:34:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想做的是一部经典的爱情片
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.52,0:34:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,电影公司向我许诺
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.52,0:34:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是在此之前他们要我先拍一部恐怖片
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.49,0:34:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们的电影流产了我也被炒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.86,0:34:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝保佑 这不是世界末日 罗曼
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.19,0:34:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的倒是轻巧 你还可以回去非看不可电视台
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.63,0:34:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可就没电影拍了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.12,0:34:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就快30岁了 看起来下一个目标应该是我
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.53,0:34:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？你？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.03,0:34:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么是你？你认为这不是一个信息吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.57,0:34:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼·布雷吉？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.54,0:34:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？布雷吉先生 你对我们隐瞒了…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.24,0:34:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在莎拉·达玲死前和她通过电话的事
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.48,0:34:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时侯和她通话？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.61,0:34:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,警卫说她来这儿是为了和你见面的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.02,0:35:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么见面？我不…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.09,0:35:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们和她室友谈过
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.48,0:35:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,说你打电话给莎拉 告诉她去摄影棚
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.02,0:35:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,室友接的电话 说那个人就是你
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.09,0:35:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我从没打电话给她 我也没通知她去过任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.46,0:35:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,室友说她知道是你的声音 布雷吉先生
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.10,0:35:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她根本没和我通话！天啊！看呐
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.10,0:35:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有打电话给莎拉·达玲
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.10,0:35:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉·达玲说就是你 有人想毁了我这部电影
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.37,0:35:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人想让这部电影流产！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.44,0:35:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,回警局再谈你的电影吧 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.44,0:35:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是你该配合我们的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.18,0:35:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威 珍妮弗… 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.55,0:35:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她根本没和我通话 我自己会走！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.59,0:35:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会再打电话给他 没电了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.06,0:35:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱利先生 能借用一下你的手机吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.62,0:35:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.26,0:35:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.43,0:35:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊罗曼
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.20,0:35:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,提醒我再也不要和他同床共枕了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.07,0:35:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 切罗基
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.77,0:35:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,加利福尼亚女性生活危机辅导 我是罗拉
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.60,0:35:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么能帮你的？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.44,0:35:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 劳拉 我确实有个大问题
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.61,0:36:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 不管是什么事 你都可以向我倾诉
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.41,0:36:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝啊我杀了人 罗拉
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.12,0:36:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说真的？嗯 是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.32,0:36:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了人 我杀了他！哦 天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.62,0:36:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 那么… 我杀了人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.26,0:36:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你应该打电话给警方
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.30,0:36:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要打给你！就是你没错
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.87,0:36:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你… 你的声音…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.94,0:36:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是想知道你在帮助谁吗 罗拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.44,0:36:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在听吗？啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.18,0:36:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？是妈妈 罗拉
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.65,0:36:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 乖乖的把电视打开看新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.45,0:36:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,照妈妈的话做！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.36,0:36:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是我妈妈 你怎么知道这个号码的？你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.36,0:36:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到这声音就该知道这是你妈妈了！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.33,0:36:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 打开电视看新闻！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.30,0:36:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在第二名演职人员被杀之后 杀戮3
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.57,0:37:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,官方宣布电影停拍 这当中隐隐看出
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.41,0:37:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,制片方希望这凶杀案能有个了结
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.71,0:37:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.05,0:37:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为这事情结束了吗 西德妮？结束了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.92,0:37:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是杀青晚会还是杀青晚会就是这样？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.36,0:37:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,场景34 「莫琳谋杀案重现」
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.56,0:37:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直不喜欢这个场景 那是因为你没入戏
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.37,0:38:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,场景40跳至场景47
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.57,0:38:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,「普莱斯柯特家重现」 汤姆 停下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.48,0:38:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你令我很惊慌 已经死了两个人了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.54,0:38:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓你？嘿！收起你那副甜美到无邪的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.48,0:38:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你醉了 我清醒的很
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.22,0:38:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢打赌她正为西德妮这个角色而惶恐不安
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.93,0:38:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌她对所有阻挡她发展的可怜女孩都会冷酷无情
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.19,0:38:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说来你要她不要参与其中但是她拒绝了？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.60,0:38:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是无能为力了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.17,0:38:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 过来 杜威
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.70,0:38:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,场景50 「杜威的壮举」
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.04,0:39:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她总是将成功建立在对别人的伤害之上
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.21,0:39:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还救过她 几次来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.51,0:39:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔希望全世界都围着她转
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.51,0:39:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人是远远不够的 她是个幻想家
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.45,0:39:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她是个自我陶醉的人 变态的婊子 不 她不是
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.89,0:39:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她心肠很好 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.19,0:39:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是将内心的柔软藏了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.44,0:39:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她认为人们会把那看作是软弱的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.33,0:39:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这张照片很漂亮 你和她很像
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.53,0:39:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊杜威
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.77,0:39:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来你好像还很爱她
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.20,0:39:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然她还有残酷…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.57,0:39:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,自私 占有欲极强和脾气暴躁的一面
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.81,0:39:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里已经有一位盖尔·韦瑟斯了 不需要第二个
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.82,0:40:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 杜威 把你的女朋友带走
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.82,0:40:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现她在院子里鬼鬼祟祟的 一件夜间新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.36,0:40:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有鬼鬼祟祟 我刚好走过
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.49,0:40:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在卧室窗外偷听
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.23,0:40:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 这屋子里看起来很可怕的一间卧室
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.40,0:40:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.27,0:40:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.91,0:40:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你玩的哪出 盖尔？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.04,0:40:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他们放了罗曼了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.08,0:40:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他并没有打电话给莎拉
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.08,0:40:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那电话是谁打的？一个仿制的手机 无迹可寻
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.55,0:40:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你带来的最新情报 盖尔 你为什么不赶快回去？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.75,0:40:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威 等等 就一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.52,0:40:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看着照片里的莫琳·普莱斯柯特有多大？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.39,0:40:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,19或者20岁吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.37,0:40:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是这么想的 所以我去查了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.33,0:40:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找不到她在这个年龄段的任何记录
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.34,0:40:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 记录一片空白
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.83,0:40:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一直住在伍兹伯勒 肯定有人知道些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.40,0:40:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的一生
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.37,0:40:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在她遇到西德妮父亲的两年前 她离开过伍兹伯勒
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.74,0:40:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人知道她去哪了或是去干了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.44,0:41:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像她去了一个黑洞 杜威！她消失了！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.71,0:41:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后？然后？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.95,0:41:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么凶手要留下莫琳的照片？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.75,0:41:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有为什么这些照片刚好是那个时间段的？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.99,0:41:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.49,0:41:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我的想法和变态杀人狂一样
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.92,0:41:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就能知道变态杀人狂的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.00,0:41:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.97,0:41:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮弗 珍妮弗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.81,0:41:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那建筑
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.81,0:41:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,看二楼 那儿和那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.25,0:41:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一模一样！这两处28年前是同一条街
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.45,0:41:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊莫琳·普莱斯柯特当时就在升阳电影公司
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.32,0:41:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊 我得联系几个人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.57,0:42:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂文·斯通保安服务
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.68,0:42:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯通 你在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.68,0:42:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在检查你的罐头 杜威
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.45,0:42:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 回到里面和珍妮弗待在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.48,0:42:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事发生了 我要去警局一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.78,0:42:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是命令吗 杜威？可是史蒂文·斯通可不为你工作
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.46,0:42:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到屋子里去 如果不是十万火急我会打给你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.16,0:42:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你在做什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.16,0:42:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我？我检查一下确保这里没有杀手…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.87,0:42:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着像杀你妹妹那样杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.80,0:42:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？真不敢相信这活从你嘴里说出来
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.97,0:42:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那让我…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.37,0:42:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,很生气！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.31,0:42:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,畜生！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.03,0:42:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须打给金凯德
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.03,0:43:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威 人都哪去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.27,0:43:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.54,0:43:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 老天 珍妮弗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.61,0:43:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,安吉莉娜？汤姆？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.42,0:43:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 老天！出什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.25,0:43:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.72,0:43:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 我太敏感了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.06,0:43:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.74,0:43:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯通？哦 天啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.97,0:43:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊斯通！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.98,0:43:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.48,0:43:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威 他死了吗？是的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.46,0:43:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都回去！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.93,0:44:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 别紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.60,0:44:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 出去 所有人待在一起保持冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.20,0:44:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我的电话 也不是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.24,0:44:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！是传真
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.85,0:44:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,「室内 珍妮弗的房子 客厅 晚上」
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.87,0:44:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个剧本的脚本
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.95,0:44:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,它… 它说什么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.50,0:44:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,「在保安被杀之后 其他五个人掉入了陷阱中」
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.09,0:44:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在重写电影 「凶手在外面伺机而动
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.06,0:44:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然间传真机发来了决定他们命运的一纸宣言「
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.70,0:44:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是陷阱！所有人出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.20,0:44:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去让他能把我们一个个的给宰了？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.23,0:44:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,「凶手只准备放过他们其中一个」
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.50,0:44:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还不明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.56,0:44:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手说他就在外面因为他要我们待在屋子里
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.87,0:44:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会放过谁？快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.28,0:44:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,「谁能活下来？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.96,0:44:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是珍妮弗？汤姆？安吉丽娜？杜威？盖尔？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.01,0:44:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀手将会放过…「 所有人出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.31,0:44:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会放过谁？我想知道事情会怎么样！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.59,0:45:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,等这该死的电影上映！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.52,0:45:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须要知道！我回去！不
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.62,0:45:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 所有人 回去 待在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.36,0:45:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面说什么？那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.66,0:45:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手会放过…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.90,0:45:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何一个人… 任何一个人？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.47,0:45:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,放屁
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.44,0:45:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,「任何… 任何一个闻到燃气的人…」
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.66,0:45:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要滚下山了！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.54,0:45:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔！珍妮弗！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.47,0:45:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威！杜威！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.54,0:45:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威 你在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.65,0:46:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 杜威！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.18,0:46:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威！盖尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.06,0:46:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔 你后面！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.07,0:46:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威！你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.61,0:46:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 好的不能再好了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.88,0:46:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我也没事 他去哪儿了？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.55,0:46:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他滚到车下去了 好了 跟紧我
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.59,0:46:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在车后吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.69,0:46:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 没有？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.56,0:46:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他动作很快 不能保证我打中他了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.84,0:46:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.27,0:47:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.77,0:47:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你救了我
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.81,0:47:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊习惯了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.18,0:47:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.92,0:47:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该死的…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.69,0:47:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.96,0:47:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮弗 等等 谁给你地方落脚的？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.63,0:47:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该保护谁？珍妮弗！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.06,0:47:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.94,0:47:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的律师会让你们后悔的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.01,0:47:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.85,0:47:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,安吉丽娜？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.65,0:47:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆在房子里 你怎么从那儿走来？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.02,0:47:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊！汤姆在屋子里！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.19,0:47:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们安全吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.70,0:47:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么不安全的？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.60,0:48:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.24,0:48:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一张照片
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.85,0:48:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了她
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.85,0:48:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管谁是凶手
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.60,0:48:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正在算莫琳·普莱斯柯特谋杀案的那笔账
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.72,0:48:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们已经知道是谁杀了莫琳·普莱斯柯特
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.54,0:48:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是比利·鲁米斯和斯图·马彻尔
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.89,0:48:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们甚至还告诉西德妮他们是怎么做的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.29,0:48:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但是如果我没记错的话
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.36,0:48:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在你的书里说过西德妮曾经搞错过一次
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.73,0:48:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她指控卡顿·威瑞谋杀了她妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.57,0:48:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他最后被证明无罪释放了 也许真的有第三个凶手
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.74,0:48:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮也许知道什么 我说了 我不知道西德妮在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.37,0:48:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且就算有第三个凶手 西德妮也不可能知道这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.08,0:48:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事我说了算 我要和她谈谈 她是这件案子的关键
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.45,0:48:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个小时后我有一个新闻发布会
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.58,0:48:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要解释为什么会死了三个演艺明星和一个保镖
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.45,0:48:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要应付气极了的市长
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.55,0:48:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们都知道这和杀戮3有关
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.26,0:48:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不知道凶手为什么一直留下照片…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.16,0:49:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是莫琳·普莱斯柯特25年前的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.83,0:49:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且照片上的背景和杀戮3的取景一模一样
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.23,0:49:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和西德妮有什么关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.40,0:49:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能比西德妮更了解她妈妈？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.17,0:49:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮的爸爸不可能帮助你因为他和莫琳结婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.97,0:49:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么回事？昨晚你差点变成一块焦炭
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.08,0:49:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想帮助我们还是怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.02,0:49:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想我拿测谎仪来测试你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.78,0:49:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算是威胁吗？当这是个威胁的时候 你会知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.15,0:49:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是威胁吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.15,0:49:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 伙计们！我们就不能先好好谈谈？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.26,0:49:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,焦点就是莫琳·普莱斯柯特
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.93,0:49:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 焦点是西德妮·普莱斯柯特
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.83,0:49:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,而莱利先生现在要阻碍案件调查并且阻止我们接触她
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.96,0:49:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么… 她在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.41,0:49:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 这是留言信箱 留下口讯 想说多久都没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.98,0:49:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 是我 这是我第五个电话了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.75,0:49:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你快接起来吧 我想知道你很安全
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.72,0:50:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.59,0:50:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.36,0:50:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.63,0:50:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！是啊我来这儿干嘛呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.23,0:50:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊杜威 你还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.23,0:50:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.17,0:50:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还好吗？嘿 你知道盖尔这个人 真是一语中的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.97,0:50:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,新闻说案件发生在这里的管区
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.37,0:50:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是那个叫金凯德的家伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.84,0:50:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.94,0:50:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你好好躲起来的 你现在来这儿不安全
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.35,0:50:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手打电话给我了 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.22,0:50:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 他发现我了 我在这儿反而更安全
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.22,0:50:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少在这儿我不会孤单
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.69,0:50:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 来
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.70,0:50:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,金凯德警长？是的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.03,0:50:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人希望能对案件调查起到帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.03,0:50:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊西德妮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.90,0:50:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是人们动作变快了还是？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.74,0:50:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 嗨 盖尔
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.18,0:51:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你没事 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.48,0:51:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 这是金凯德警长
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.97,0:51:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴总算见到你了 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.52,0:51:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手打电话给她了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.35,0:51:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？什么时候？他说什么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.62,0:51:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你知道 和以前一样的威胁 有什么新鲜的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.41,0:51:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样 你想怎么个死法？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.13,0:51:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 你有想过他是怎么知道你的号码的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.43,0:51:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能是用扫描仪在监视她的通话
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.19,0:51:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用座机打给她过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.37,0:51:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 你有她号码的记录吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.24,0:51:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,通话记录！哦 是的 我想是的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.51,0:51:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有任何曾经使用过你的手机吗？就珍妮弗了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.58,0:51:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.68,0:51:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我是这儿的警察 你在我的办公室里 莱利
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.39,0:51:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手在每一起凶杀案之后都会留下一张照片 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.09,0:51:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,照片都是在杀戮3设在好莱坞的摄影棚拍摄的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.30,0:51:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什不告诉我？这是我妈妈 杜威
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.58,0:51:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么什么都不说？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.97,0:51:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害怕它们是诱饵 有些事 你知道 想把你引出来
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.37,0:52:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 她曾经是个演员还是模特？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.70,0:52:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们看起来很像宣传照
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.14,0:52:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 嗯 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.98,0:52:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长 我想去看看照片里的这个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.58,0:52:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定？是的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.52,0:52:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.16,0:52:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心那个该死的外星人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.90,0:52:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去和公司老总谈谈这些照片的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.43,0:52:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 去吧 我知道那个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.43,0:52:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意西德妮 我知道你去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.87,0:52:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算给她买一些花和糖果 嗯？呃？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.61,0:52:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,放过我吧 好的 保持联系
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.84,0:52:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心保护她
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.18,0:52:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个楼梯就在那儿 其中一张照片拍摄的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.29,0:52:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢相信她从没提过这些事 杜威！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.96,0:52:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 玛莎！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.76,0:52:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊西德妮 嘿 待在那儿别动！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.86,0:53:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪 我只有17岁 没事 是熟人
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.27,0:53:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.30,0:53:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你和我说这是他的前女友 我就开枪崩了自己
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.27,0:53:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是玛莎·米克斯 兰迪的妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.77,0:53:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰迪的妹妹？是的 你认不出来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.34,0:53:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们伍兹伯勒的朋友很想你
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.09,0:53:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莎 你在这儿干嘛呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.54,0:53:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些东西你们得看看
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.52,0:53:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,早就说了我总有一天会拍一部电影的 嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.15,0:53:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.09,0:53:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 如果你们看到这片子
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.62,0:53:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就意味着 我挂了 没能在温莎大学
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.73,0:53:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场屠杀中幸存下来 还有把我的贞操献给了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.63,0:53:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,影碟店的凯伦·高尔察克也许不是个好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.07,0:53:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯伦·高尔察克？是的 凯伦·高尔察克
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.23,0:53:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,「疯子凯伦」？闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.37,0:53:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个小甜妞 好吗？我们通常工作到恨晚
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.61,0:53:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把一些色情片整理好 然后 你们知道 做那事了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.18,0:53:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门 兰迪！15分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.65,0:53:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是我的房间！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.14,0:53:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,保罗 给我15分钟 我在留下我的遗物
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.92,0:53:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就15分钟 保罗！去死！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.99,0:53:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,闲话少说 我是来帮助你们的…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.09,0:54:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样对我的死也不会毫无价值
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.19,0:54:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用生命换来的工作将会挽救很多可怜的人
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.43,0:54:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果凶手真的回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.83,0:54:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么他就是来真的 有几件事你们要记住
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.67,0:54:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是简单的续集吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.03,0:54:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 如果是的话 那么规则相通
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.14,0:54:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 关键就在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.21,0:54:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们发现自己是在经历一个完全陌生的背景故事
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.75,0:54:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一大堆的说明 那续集的规则就不适用
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.35,0:54:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你们经历的不是续集 你们经历的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.09,0:54:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,三部曲的终章
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.39,0:54:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,三部曲 是的 这是一个罕见的恐怖领域
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.16,0:54:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它确实存在 而且它是一股不可忽视的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.03,0:54:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为真正的三部曲最终是会回到原点并发现某些事的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.40,0:54:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那从一开始就不是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.77,0:54:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,教父 绝境 我们认为是真的但那未必是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.44,0:54:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果你们经历的三部曲
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.88,0:54:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有一些超级三部曲的规则
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.11,0:54:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一：你们面对的是个超级杀手
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.35,0:54:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,用刀桶他没用 用枪打他也没用
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.35,0:54:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本来说 第三步
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.47,0:55:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须冻住他的头 把他的头砍下来
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.55,0:55:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者一枪打爆他的头
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.42,0:55:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二：任何人 包括主角 都会死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.29,0:55:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就意味着是你 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.69,0:55:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 这是终章了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.26,0:55:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情可不会演变成电影「落水狗」里那种简单的仇杀
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.90,0:55:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三：过去的事会死咬着不放
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.23,0:55:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你认为自己有多了解过去 忘了它
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.48,0:55:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去的事可没有放弃对你的追逐！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.44,0:55:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为什么都已消散的罪恶即将爆发并吞噬你
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.94,0:55:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我私下告诉你们 祝你们…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.21,0:55:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好运 上帝与你们同在
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.02,0:55:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都一样 你们很快就能见到我
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.22,0:55:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为规则上说了你们中间有人过不了这关 就比如我
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.76,0:55:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则你们就不会看到这盘带子了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.33,0:55:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.33,0:55:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要小心点 代我像你家人问好
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.97,0:55:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也要小心 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.41,0:55:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 杜威 早点来看看我们
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.41,0:56:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的 玛莎 谢谢你 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.23,0:56:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有点事 稍后和你们联系 要我们一起去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.63,0:56:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个人更方便
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.82,0:56:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么不去找出其他照片是在哪儿拍的？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.81,0:56:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看得出来她没什么变化 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.34,0:56:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 该死
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.75,0:56:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.20,0:56:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你在这干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.37,0:56:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,扮演盖尔·韦瑟斯 你在这干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.74,0:56:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才是盖尔·韦瑟斯
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.30,0:56:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是这么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.05,0:56:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在没有房子 没有保镖 没电影可拍
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.10,0:56:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且正在被追杀
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.97,0:56:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有人想杀我？不 因为有人想杀你
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.34,0:56:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始 你去哪我去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.42,0:56:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样的话 如果有人想杀我 我会拖着你
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.41,0:56:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且如果他们真的想杀你
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.41,0:56:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们就不会杀我 他们将会杀你
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.75,0:57:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了吗？不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.25,0:57:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我在电影中扮演的你比你本人聪明多了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.79,0:57:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像个很理智的人 对你来说 这种表演技巧很容易
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.39,0:57:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有趣 哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.73,0:57:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,要进去？是的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.90,0:57:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面真的有什么玄机？也许吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.80,0:57:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔·韦瑟斯会找到办法的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.44,0:57:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,婊子 好吧 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.47,0:57:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是… 别教我怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.48,0:57:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下室 哇哦
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.48,0:57:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下室让我浑身发毛
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.65,0:57:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会有一个神奇的采访经历
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.99,0:57:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.00,0:57:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 打扰一下 我是盖尔·韦瑟斯
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.01,0:57:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在协助警察调查… 这张照片
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.41,0:58:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来像在摄影棚拍的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.86,0:58:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫莫琳·普莱斯柯特 当时叫罗伯茨
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.18,0:58:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你… 不
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.62,0:58:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你看起来… 像她？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.10,0:58:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一辈子都在听她的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.99,0:58:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是不可思议 我可是准备成为莱娅公主了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.66,0:58:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和她如此相像 那么谁搞到那张照片的？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.18,0:58:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,和乔治·卢卡斯上过床的人？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.90,0:58:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不是想揭你的伤疤的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.47,0:58:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 你不想 没人想
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.47,0:58:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我能帮你什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.28,0:58:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是想我告诉你你长的像谁吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.51,0:58:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼 我想知道一些莫琳·罗伯茨的信息？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.84,0:58:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不为警察工作 甜心 我是电影公司的人
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.35,0:58:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 嗯 你难道不是为…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.25,0:58:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统工作？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.69,0:58:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也是… 电影公司的总统
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.66,0:58:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,50美元？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.03,0:58:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？伍兹伯勒高中来的记者？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.44,0:59:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个值2000美元
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.50,0:59:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算帮助盖尔·韦瑟斯还是怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.91,0:59:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿的每个人我都认识
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.85,0:59:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不出名的演员都很尊敬我
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.75,0:59:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们是在找莫琳·罗伯茨 那他们永远也找不到
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.55,0:59:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只能找到瑞娜·雷诺兹
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.59,0:59:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞娜·雷诺兹
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.93,0:59:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,艺名
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.29,0:59:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才需要艺名 朱迪·乔根斯坦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.90,0:59:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是什么电影？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.90,0:59:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚马逊野人 空间杀人狂 圣安地列斯断层的生物
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.07,0:59:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怖电影在米尔顿的鼎盛时期回归
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.48,0:59:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么回来？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.58,0:59:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·米尔顿 恐怖电影制片人？那些都是他的电影
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.81,1:00:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,振作 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.17,1:00:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊！西德妮·普莱斯柯特！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.21,1:00:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊！我是安吉丽·娜泰勒 我扮演的是你！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.02,1:00:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 我不是
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.15,1:00:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 曾经是
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.29,1:00:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我… 我想
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.56,1:01:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 既然没什么电影了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.07,1:01:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就没人会在乎我拿些纪念品了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.06,1:01:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,纪念品？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.56,1:01:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没获得过别的角色
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.40,1:01:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这也许是我唯一的记忆了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.40,1:01:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 好莱坞的记忆
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.17,1:01:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这有点奇怪因为这毕竟是你的生活 但是
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.77,1:01:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让你感到骄傲 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.18,1:01:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是的 我想我会的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.91,1:01:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,真实的西德妮 真实的人
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.35,1:01:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.09,1:01:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望电影已经拍好了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.67,1:01:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.67,1:01:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,安吉丽娜？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.02,1:02:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.71,1:03:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,死里逃生
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.71,1:03:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.81,1:03:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说 我从没能悄悄的从窗户爬入你的卧室
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.68,1:03:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道你对我做了什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.92,1:03:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我做的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.92,1:03:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种事情？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.36,1:03:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我并不是想催促你
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.09,1:03:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会接收这种限制级的关系吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.28,1:05:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.60,1:06:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.54,1:06:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 我在这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.01,1:06:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.75,1:06:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 妈妈不会让你被那些坏人伤害的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.85,1:06:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,来卧室
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.79,1:06:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏在妈妈床上
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.43,1:06:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说谎了 西德妮 我没有能力保护你
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.53,1:06:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不值得我保护！你都没保护我！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.70,1:06:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮了你妈妈个忙 那个女人是个下贱的妓女…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.41,1:06:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在镇上水性杨花 好像自己是莎朗·斯通
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.91,1:06:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们正视这个事实 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.81,1:06:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈不是什么莎朗·斯通
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.55,1:06:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮的妈妈勾引了我爸爸 西德妮 你在哪？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.08,1:07:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威！杜威 救我！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.99,1:07:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮？给妈妈一个吻吧 我们就能再续前缘
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.06,1:07:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！西德妮！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.53,1:07:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.30,1:07:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 你还好吗？出什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.57,1:07:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手在房子里 杜威 他在楼上
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.74,1:07:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我妈妈… 我们走 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.38,1:07:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到她的声音 我看见她了 杜威
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.15,1:07:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,上楼 快 走 没事的 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.55,1:07:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该进那个屋子的 那都是以凶案现场为模版造的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.96,1:07:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉让你见到这里 他在里面
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.96,1:07:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在里面 我发誓 我发誓 你知道我相信你
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.93,1:07:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？金凯德 嘿 这上面没人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.94,1:07:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.85,1:08:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.82,1:08:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 就算我偷了面具又怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.82,1:08:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你要把我送进毒气室？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.35,1:08:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偷了这面具？我拿来看看
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.86,1:08:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿了这面具还是偷了这面具？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.79,1:08:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把它当作纪念品拿出来的 别看我 我什么都没拿
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.06,1:08:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他在那儿 我没有做梦 也没有发疯
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.30,1:08:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就在那伍兹伯勒中 那不是伍兹伯勒 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.93,1:08:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白我的意思
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.42,1:08:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他在那儿 他或者是她 不管是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.70,1:08:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会将你送回警局 保护你的安全
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.44,1:08:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会住在安全屋 不管发生什么
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.01,1:08:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.35,1:08:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 西德妮 我们都相信你
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.48,1:08:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手在看着这一切 他想要杀的就是你
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.16,1:08:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 杜威 杜威
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.09,1:08:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我们要跟上西德妮 先看看这个
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.96,1:08:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是我们认识的那个？你们哪找到的？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.13,1:08:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在档案室搞到的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.13,1:08:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮的妈妈演过三部电影 恐怖电影
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.60,1:09:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道导演是谁吗？谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.84,1:09:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有别的电影会开拍的 罗曼
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.97,1:09:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不但搅黄了我的电影 还杀了我的演员
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.98,1:09:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没人愿意和我合作了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.22,1:09:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,圈内开始把我看成不入流的小导演了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.95,1:09:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道这不入流的导演是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.85,1:09:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么那些人不去杀杀戮1的演员？啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.22,1:09:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是杀戮2的？为什么是我？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.36,1:09:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么… 约翰 我们做错什么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.72,1:09:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好莱坞是一个极其势力的罪恶圈子
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.16,1:09:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是个罪犯！我却被带去审问
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.69,1:09:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 但是就这样 我被审问了 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.70,1:09:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对提升你的神秘感有好处
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.26,1:09:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为这对我的工作有帮助？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.80,1:09:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼 约翰
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.90,1:09:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮弗 还有贵客 什么风把你们给吹来了？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.17,1:09:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞娜·雷诺兹
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.43,1:09:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞娜·雷诺兹？谁是瑞娜·雷诺兹？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.24,1:09:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不去片场？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.55,1:09:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让大家不用等我了 先切蛋糕吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.51,1:09:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊我忘了 今天是你的生日
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.78,1:09:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 看起来生活好有点盼头 生日快乐 罗曼
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.48,1:09:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,关上门 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.22,1:09:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你认识西德妮的妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.02,1:09:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？瑞娜·雷诺兹？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.59,1:10:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊你知道有多少演员在我手下工作过吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.20,1:10:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,成千上万
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.77,1:10:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没说她是个演员 说得好
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.07,1:10:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你们到底想说什么？呃 没什么意思
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.60,1:10:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是打算个金凯德警长打个电话
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.64,1:10:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想起来了 她好像在我的几部电影里演过小角色
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.71,1:10:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个小角色 那又怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.45,1:10:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 得了 你已经用她的谋杀案赚了上百万了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.02,1:10:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初你迷恋她 现在你迷恋她的女儿！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.92,1:10:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动 杰拉尔多 为什么你不告诉我们真相？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.63,1:10:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些家伙都听了什么风言风语？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.39,1:10:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只不过是拍了几部恐怖电影
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.83,1:10:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在公司发生的凶案是冲我来的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.06,1:10:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是冲我来的 去查查
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.03,1:10:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你认识她 当我们拍第一部杀戮的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.90,1:10:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才意识到我以前就认识莫琳·普莱斯柯特 就是瑞娜
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.78,1:10:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能告诉任何人 你们能想像那种压力吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.95,1:10:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那现在呢？我的意思是 你的片场发生了凶杀案
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.58,1:10:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你还能装做没事？现实点
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.08,1:10:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会让我成为嫌疑人 就因为你认识她？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.85,1:10:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我不这么认为
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.32,1:11:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫琳在好莱坞的时候到底发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.76,1:11:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你听好了 路易斯·莱恩
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.05,1:11:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再追究了 事情已经过去并被掩埋
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.60,1:11:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这事在官方电视台上放出来会怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.10,1:11:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不告诉我到底发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.87,1:11:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是70年代的时候 一切都不同了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.81,1:11:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我因为我的聚会而出名
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.84,1:11:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞娜知道那是怎么一回事
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.21,1:11:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种聚会就是为了给像她那样的女孩物色男人
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.25,1:11:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,而男人也能得到…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.78,1:11:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果男女彼此间印象不错的话
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.85,1:11:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她并没有被别人以这样或那样的方式邀请
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.66,1:11:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管她说了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.76,1:11:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说她… 我是说事情完全失控了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.23,1:11:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们只是利用她 也许悲惨的事实就是…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.47,1:11:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是座无辜之城
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.60,1:11:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不存在任何指控 而结果就是…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.31,1:11:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞娜·雷诺兹没有按规则来玩游戏
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.14,1:11:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想在好莱坞站住脚跟？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.28,1:11:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须去玩这个游戏 要么你就卷铺盖回家
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.19,1:12:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对三部曲知道多少？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.49,1:12:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 像电影三部曲这种的？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.13,1:12:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像很喜欢电影 警长
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.36,1:12:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我马克 好吗？因为我一直叫你西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.06,1:12:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抓到凶手我才会叫你马克 警长
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.40,1:12:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所知道的关于三部曲的事就是在那最后一部之中
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.21,1:12:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事情都有可能发生
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.21,1:12:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你主动请求接手这个案子的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.21,1:12:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他们更希望把我用于处理那些文职工作上
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.02,1:12:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里长大 我知道在办公室的生存方式
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.39,1:12:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.75,1:12:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定很有意思 漂亮的地方 友好的同事
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.22,1:12:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说 好莱坞意味着死亡
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.39,1:12:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.17,1:12:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一个谋杀警长 记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.67,1:12:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你见到所见到的这一切 一天又一天的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.14,1:12:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们互相之间血腥攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.84,1:12:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你简直就是在受折磨
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.88,1:13:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你该知道
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.11,1:13:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.55,1:13:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道阴魂不散是什么感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.79,1:13:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在大脑里上演一部恐怖片 不管你愿不愿意
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.36,1:13:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,就只有你独自一人观看
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.76,1:13:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼魂是很棘手的 你无法对鬼开枪
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.80,1:13:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也逮捕不了它们
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.77,1:13:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是摆脱这种折磨最好的办法就是和别人在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.67,1:13:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿 你没有躲藏 你做的没错 普莱斯柯特小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.12,1:13:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于你妈妈你知道些什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.69,1:13:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总以为自己有一个完美的妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.93,1:13:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美的家庭
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.93,1:13:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我发现自己错了 她 嗯…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.24,1:14:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一生很神秘 我试着解开谜团 但是 嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.51,1:14:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快我发现 谜团竟然越解越多
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.32,1:14:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本不知道自己的妈妈是个怎样的人
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.45,1:14:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道她对你来说意味着什么
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.86,1:14:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.13,1:14:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在要去搜查片场我认为你看到的是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.07,1:14:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个好消息
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.03,1:14:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么就是好消息呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.94,1:14:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那意味着我们面对的只是一位普通的冷血杀手
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.51,1:14:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道怎么对付这种人 哦 是吗？怎么对付？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.18,1:14:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他… 或者杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.42,1:14:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 警长
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.79,1:14:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最喜欢的恐怖片是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.16,1:14:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的一生
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.20,1:15:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.54,1:15:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得制订个战略
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.54,1:15:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔顿是所有事的关键 他是个变态 但不是个杀手
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.57,1:15:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定和这件事有牵连 我们该跟着他
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.54,1:15:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在要去警局告诉金凯德和西德妮我们发现了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.68,1:15:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饰演的盖尔会更加咄咄逼人
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.48,1:15:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饰演的盖尔会怀疑任何人
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.48,1:15:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饰演的盖尔会… 闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.72,1:15:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是莱利 请讲 杜威 是我 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.59,1:15:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 西德妮 我和盖尔在一起 我们正赶去找你
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.15,1:15:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.83,1:15:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我并不在警局
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.03,1:15:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰米·尔顿打电话给我说有事情要告诉我
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.40,1:15:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于我妈妈的事 我现在去他家见他
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.93,1:15:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 西德妮 我不认为这是个好主意
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.34,1:15:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系的 金凯德和我一起去 我有官方的…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.47,1:15:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛杉矶警察保护 但是如果你们也能来我会更加安心
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.98,1:15:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上到 但是 西德妮… 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.95,1:15:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.08,1:15:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们最后还是得去那个聚会
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.80,1:16:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们 来啊尽情享受吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.20,1:16:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 但事实上 我们是来找西德妮的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.10,1:16:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？西德妮在这 哪？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.40,1:16:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮在哪？就在那儿！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.84,1:16:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天！不是扮演的西德妮 是真的西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.34,1:16:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我是扮演盖尔而她才是盖尔
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.65,1:16:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮·普莱斯柯特？是的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.78,1:16:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我没请过她 她说她来了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.98,1:16:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 人越多越好
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.22,1:16:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊这房子真让人震惊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.72,1:16:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是老好莱坞
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.73,1:16:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 这家伙还会有更多的钱吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.89,1:16:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕米尔顿还有间秘密放映室…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.43,1:16:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像70年代的那种感觉 你们应该知道
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.90,1:16:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像有酒 毒品 姑娘 电影还有那事儿
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.47,1:16:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦！真希望我能看看
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.04,1:16:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,仿古的大型放映室应该不难找 我去找找看
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.64,1:16:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦！等等 有个变态杀手可是一直在伺机而动
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.25,1:17:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你想一个人在这个大屋里晃荡？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.98,1:17:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有看过杀戮系列的电影？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.52,1:17:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次那家伙进入房间 就代表着最后会有人死去
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.32,1:17:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你一起去 罗曼 好的 你们要去吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.59,1:17:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样很好 我们可以待在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.36,1:17:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这可不叫待在一起 等等 我们在这里等西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.13,1:17:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上回来！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.87,1:17:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果 如果你是个放映室
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.24,1:17:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会在哪儿呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.05,1:17:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌在地下室
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.18,1:17:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢地下室
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.16,1:17:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 令人毛骨悚然
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.74,1:17:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 亡父的海报 该死 这儿太黑了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.97,1:17:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢那部电影
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.02,1:17:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别提什么电影了！如果米尔顿疯了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.98,1:18:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他会不会手持风扇叶片突然出现在放映室？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.51,1:18:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会 你确定？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.35,1:18:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在那儿？野人和外星人
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.26,1:18:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 就像没化妆的你 珍妮弗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.36,1:18:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别装作我不是你最好的女友
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.04,1:18:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别以为我还对你念念不忘
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.23,1:18:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别装了！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.97,1:18:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.22,1:18:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.16,1:18:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有她的迹象吗？没有
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.73,1:18:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.40,1:18:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.40,1:19:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手机有来电显示吗？有
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.97,1:19:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,打回去看看
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.08,1:19:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么声音？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.96,1:19:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.23,1:19:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是那个杀手的…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.97,1:19:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.04,1:19:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威 他录制了我们的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.61,1:19:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也录制了西德妮的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.74,1:19:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他搞到了我们所有人的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.78,1:19:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊我们得找到她 来
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.65,1:19:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 拿上枪
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.65,1:19:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去找罗曼和珍妮弗 我去找另两个
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.79,1:19:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 你也是
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.46,1:20:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰森！安吉丽娜！你在在那儿吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.10,1:20:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.10,1:20:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰森！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.20,1:20:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,安吉丽娜！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.61,1:20:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.61,1:20:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！没事 来 我们得离开这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.91,1:20:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,安吉丽娜在哪儿？我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.91,1:20:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她去了里面，我原本跟着她的，现在找不到她了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.07,1:20:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.58,1:20:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了？恐怕杀戮3要重新上演了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.22,1:20:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.09,1:20:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮弗！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.67,1:20:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮弗！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.41,1:20:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.68,1:20:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮弗！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.23,1:21:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.55,1:21:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了？是的 必死无疑
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.85,1:21:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威！杜威！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.29,1:21:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.36,1:21:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.70,1:21:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊抱歉 看呐 我发现一条秘密通道
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.73,1:21:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼死了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.23,1:21:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？什么？　 那个杀手在这里 来
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.94,1:21:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我走！我要出去！你一个人不安全！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.67,1:21:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.74,1:21:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不会为了一个角色
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.28,1:21:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,和那个垃圾米尔顿干那事儿
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.89,1:22:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你们俩一样死在这个二流聚会上
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.42,1:22:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔！我在上面 来
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.93,1:22:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威！你们也该离开
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.56,1:22:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,再待在这里简直是疯了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.80,1:22:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.20,1:22:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.79,1:22:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔 珍妮弗 我在这儿 杜威 找到你了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.66,1:22:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀了罗曼和安吉丽娜
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.33,1:22:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在一起就能安全 不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.37,1:22:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 为什么…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.17,1:22:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了？哦 该死！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.00,1:22:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！杜威！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.41,1:23:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.58,1:23:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.69,1:23:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察！救命啊！救命啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.13,1:23:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察！救命啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.04,1:23:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你个狗娘养的！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.58,1:24:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.88,1:24:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威！杜威！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.02,1:24:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在镜子后面 杜威！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.73,1:24:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔！走开！杜威！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.53,1:24:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到什么了吗？离我远点 垃圾 我不怕你
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.97,1:24:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看呐 盖尔 镜子在动
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.91,1:24:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔！盖尔！退后 盖尔
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.48,1:24:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能杀我 我是杀戮3里面的杀手 我是杀手！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.85,1:24:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔 遮住耳朵！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.65,1:24:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.36,1:25:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰森！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.07,1:25:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰森！我下去看看 你们打电话求救
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.14,1:25:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.74,1:25:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰森！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.87,1:25:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰森？有他的踪迹吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.65,1:25:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 好的 我去前面看看
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.99,1:25:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.28,1:25:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.75,1:25:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.16,1:26:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.63,1:26:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.23,1:26:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.43,1:26:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.34,1:26:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁？杜威 是我
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.14,1:26:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔… 你在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.28,1:26:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在地下室 被困住了 哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.45,1:26:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,厨房里有个门
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.65,1:26:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.66,1:26:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我怎么知道你是盖尔本人 而不是杀手？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.60,1:26:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威 快帮我从外面把该死的门打开 就是我
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.37,1:26:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你不认为杀手就是会这样说吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.24,1:26:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 他昏过去了… 就在楼梯下面
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.21,1:26:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.42,1:27:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威 杜威
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.17,1:27:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了 只是个批萨 可不是舞会
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.64,1:27:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人回去工作 有人见过我那垃圾搭档吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.44,1:27:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 摩根 你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.70,1:28:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好？你好？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.13,1:28:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪位？你是哪位？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.80,1:28:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 谁打来的？嗯 谁打来的？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.94,1:28:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔 杜威 不管谁 稍后再打给我
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.26,1:28:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在只能听到自己的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.68,1:28:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也只听到你的声音 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.35,1:28:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁？问题不是我是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.89,1:28:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是：我抓了谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.36,1:28:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 别过来！西德妮！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.66,1:28:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要冲动 如果你作出任何异常的举动
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.60,1:28:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何一个举动 我就会杀了他们
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.63,1:29:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你能去个安静的地方和我单独谈谈吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.17,1:29:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.48,1:29:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 和你成为朋友真的很困难 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.68,1:29:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你成为西德妮的朋友的时候 你就会死
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.99,1:29:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这几个朋友可以不必死 这全看你了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.46,1:29:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道这声音是… 是真的？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.73,1:29:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道听到的可能是录音？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.80,1:29:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我是不是那个萦绕在你脑海的那个人？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.70,1:29:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些事你知道的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.97,1:29:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过来 西德妮！杜威！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.01,1:29:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来不来？你死定了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.14,1:29:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想杀他们 我只想杀你
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.61,1:29:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情很简单 你现身 他们能活下去
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.06,1:29:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跑了 他们就死定了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.58,1:29:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.62,1:29:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 你想不想知道谁杀了她？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.35,1:29:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想不想知道谁杀了你妈妈？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.79,1:29:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到过金凯德吗？是的 我看着他出去的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.39,1:29:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,地点？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.03,1:30:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我们能在一起 西德妮 你妈妈会很开心的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.03,1:30:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,地点？你出去我自然会告诉你
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.51,1:30:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 该死
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.51,1:30:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.21,1:31:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.46,1:31:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？你做得很好 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.16,1:31:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 欢迎来到最后的舞台
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.53,1:31:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那个金属探测仪了？探测自己
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.94,1:31:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,全身都要扫描 西德妮 全身上下
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.65,1:32:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一处都要扫描 另一只腿也要扫描
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.69,1:32:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿出来
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.09,1:32:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔进泳池
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.73,1:32:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 进来 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.80,1:32:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,想都别想 我怎么知道他们还活着？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.97,1:32:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就在里面 等着你
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.48,1:32:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己看看
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.82,1:32:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我们都到了 舞会现在开始
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.09,1:32:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.60,1:32:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪？不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.73,1:32:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那儿！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.48,1:33:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 该死
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.78,1:33:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,动脑子想想吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.05,1:33:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在轮到你尖叫了 垃圾
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.82,1:33:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.29,1:33:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 等一会儿
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.40,1:33:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 快点 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.00,1:33:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.67,1:33:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去哪儿了？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.01,1:33:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.19,1:33:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到枪声 泰森死了 出什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.86,1:33:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿干嘛 金凯德？找你啊
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.66,1:33:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰森说这儿今晚有个舞会 那我就想 「啊哦
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.83,1:33:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后的狂欢「 我想我还是过来看看比较好
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.10,1:33:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就你一个人？你的搭档呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.24,1:34:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 普莱斯柯特小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.47,1:34:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来帮忙的 把枪放下
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.08,1:34:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.25,1:34:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.89,1:34:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮！醒醒 西德妮！西德妮 醒醒！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.83,1:34:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒！西德妮！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.53,1:34:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪 西德妮 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.50,1:34:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 朝那个混蛋开枪！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.21,1:34:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.72,1:34:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是想杀我吗 畜生？来抓我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.92,1:34:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.64,1:35:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.87,1:35:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.51,1:35:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧… 求求你
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.95,1:35:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.19,1:36:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我是如此美丽
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.56,1:36:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都喜欢我
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.66,1:36:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有想我吗 西德妮？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.67,1:36:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想不想最后拥抱我一次呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.94,1:36:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？你在看什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.74,1:36:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得自己的… 妈妈了？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.59,1:36:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哪都逃不了了 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.39,1:36:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是时候和我还有你妈妈达成协议了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.63,1:36:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你从来都不了解她 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.64,1:36:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你无法看穿表象
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.24,1:36:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是谁？你的另一半
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.35,1:37:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也在找我妈妈 一个名叫瑞娜·雷诺兹的女演员
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.12,1:37:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,试着去了解她的一生
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.22,1:37:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,四年前 我总算找到她了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.12,1:37:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,敲开她的门 原以为她会张开双臂欢迎我
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.96,1:37:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他有了一个新的生活
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.36,1:37:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,和新的名字：莫琳·普莱斯柯特
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.23,1:37:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是她唯一承认的孩子　西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.27,1:37:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她永远把我甩在了冰天雪地之中
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.33,1:37:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的亲生儿子
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.74,1:37:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼·布雷吉 导演 你哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.78,1:37:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她当着我的面重重的关上了门
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.11,1:37:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说我是瑞娜的孩子 而瑞娜已经死了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.02,1:37:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这深深地触动了我
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.16,1:37:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是多好的主意！所以我开始监视她
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.93,1:37:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拍了一部小制作的家庭电影
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.33,1:37:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,一部小制作的家庭电影
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.70,1:37:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来莫琳… 妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.17,1:37:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她开始走红了 我是说 卡顿那是另一回事
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.04,1:37:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都知道
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.41,1:38:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是比利的爸爸？那是关键
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.74,1:38:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你男朋友不想看到他爸爸在我的电影里太入戏
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.57,1:38:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他非常不喜欢
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.98,1:38:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我给了他们一点动机
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.00,1:38:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些孩子需要的只是一些指导
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.65,1:38:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,找个合作伙伴 万一自己被抓了还能来个栽赃嫁祸
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.56,1:38:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像是他在拍这部电影
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.49,1:38:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 都是因为你
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.86,1:38:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是导演 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.53,1:38:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要导演这一切 哦
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.74,1:38:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择… 他们拍了一部自己的电影
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.84,1:38:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,电影最后会变成什么样 啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.71,1:38:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 介绍西德妮 受害人
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.25,1:38:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 那个幸存者 西德妮 那个明星！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.77,1:39:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好了 你会没事的 顶住
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.37,1:39:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿 拿着这个 杀了那个畜生
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.91,1:39:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.64,1:39:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 你得到了你想要的 英雄和恶棍面对面交流
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.91,1:39:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道现在是什么情况吗？坏人必死！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.29,1:39:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的！但是
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.45,1:39:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是坏人 西德妮 你才是
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.22,1:39:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这儿 这个男人毁了你妈妈的清白
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.79,1:39:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？就是他让你妈妈变成一个荡妇
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.36,1:39:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗？嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.36,1:39:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一直没有从那晚在这个房间中发生的惨剧中恢复过来
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.86,1:39:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们从周日开始用各种办法玩弄她 毁了她的一生
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.03,1:39:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也毁了你的一生 不是吗 西德妮？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.47,1:39:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你恨他吗 西德妮？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.61,1:39:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我知道你恨他 我很肯定你恨他
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.61,1:39:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你骨子里是什么样的人
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.61,1:39:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我妈妈发生了什么事 我也明白
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.68,1:39:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你付出代价的！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.92,1:39:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是警察会在米尔顿的答录机听到的东西…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.72,1:39:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就放在他奄奄一息 血肉模糊的尸体边上
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.06,1:39:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？听不清你说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.79,1:39:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没必要这么做 告诉我你想要什么
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.99,1:39:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都可以答应 任何图片
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.37,1:40:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是你的预算 还是你写的剧本
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.06,1:40:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有最后的剪辑！我已经有了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.43,1:40:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.47,1:40:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！你个没种的混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.60,1:40:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 西德妮 是你 是你干的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.64,1:40:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是你干的 你打电话叫他们来
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.21,1:40:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至是你最亲密的… 朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.98,1:40:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直与世隔绝 这是另一部电影给你带来的压迫
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.85,1:40:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现米尔顿毁了你妈妈的一生
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.78,1:40:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你终于愤怒了！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.02,1:40:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.43,1:40:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那谁是我们英雄 啊？唯一的幸存者
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.36,1:40:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是勇敢面对变态杀手并且
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.84,1:40:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,以其人之道还治其人之身的英雄？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.77,1:40:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要为偷了我的一生而付出代价 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.87,1:40:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷了我的妈妈 偷了我的家庭 还有那些演员和
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.87,1:40:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！你所拥有的一切都是我的！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.24,1:40:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不停止抱怨做自己该做的事情？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.24,1:40:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些屁话我早就听过了！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.48,1:40:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,住嘴！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.94,1:40:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你为什么要杀人吗 罗曼？你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.95,1:40:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想听到！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.87,1:40:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为是你自己选的！你不能怨恨任何你！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.15,1:40:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,住嘴！该死的东西！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.92,1:41:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么就没种负起责任？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.62,1:41:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠你妈的！靠你妈的！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.57,1:41:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮？西德妮？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.18,1:41:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.73,1:41:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.94,1:41:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.55,1:42:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要伤害她！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.53,1:42:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威 快想想办法！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.70,1:42:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后！杜威！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.37,1:42:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.81,1:42:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.53,1:42:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.87,1:43:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.86,1:43:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.46,1:43:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,找不到什么东西吗？找到某些东西
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.62,1:43:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定还有别的路！来！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.09,1:43:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你敢伤害她 我发誓我会杀了你
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.04,1:44:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.01,1:44:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来这边 有个走廊
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.43,1:44:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面另有个门
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.37,1:44:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些东西没用
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.84,1:44:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,找些重家伙 去那边 好的！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.13,1:45:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明明打中你了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.41,1:45:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们的想法一样
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.61,1:45:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈的死
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.15,1:45:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对这件事无能为力
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.65,1:45:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是要继续我的电影
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.89,1:45:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀戮3 对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.34,1:45:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,金凯德 坚持住
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.75,1:45:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.75,1:45:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼是凶手？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.94,1:46:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 西德妮 兰迪说凶手一般都是超人
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.15,1:46:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但是 他可不是什么超人 杜威
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.75,1:46:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他根本不是超人
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.39,1:46:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们根本杀不死我！头部！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.70,1:46:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,头部！头部杜威！什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.17,1:46:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,头部！射他的头部
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.51,1:47:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.42,1:47:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.49,1:47:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.88,1:47:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,看呐
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.85,1:47:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 切罗基 过来
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.18,1:47:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 她做的很不错 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.59,1:47:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.19,1:47:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿着这个干嘛呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.56,1:47:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你愿意给我签个名吗 盖尔？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.20,1:47:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你讨厌这本书
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.04,1:47:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 我也不再做那种报道了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.44,1:48:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了我 你愿意为我签个名吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.35,1:48:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是固执
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.45,1:48:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.23,1:48:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意吗？杜威
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.80,1:48:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这招没什么用 你也知道
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.30,1:48:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我想的是… 我们是否错过了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.91,1:48:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不可能知道所有的事 盖尔
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.68,1:48:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 你认为你知道 但是…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.43,1:48:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个勇敢的男人 杜威·莱利
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.43,1:48:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在真的很害怕
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.61,1:49:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.22,1:49:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 我们等你很久了 我们要开拍一部电影
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.89,1:49:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么电影？你一定要来看看
